如何考进部委？</div></a><!----><!----></div></div><nz-modal _ngcontent-sc200="" nzcentered="" nzclassname="fb-recommended-lecture-modal"></nz-modal><!----><!----><!----></fb-recommended-lectures></div></div><div _ngcontent-sc210="" class="homepage-content-wrapper"><div _ngcontent-sc210="" class="homepage-teacher-introductions-wrapper"><fb-teacher-introductions _ngcontent-sc210="" _nghost-sc201=""><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introductions-wrapper"><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introductions-title-wrapper"><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introductions-title-icon"></div><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introductions-title">师资介绍</div></div><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introductions-contents-wrapper"><nz-tabset _ngcontent-sc201="" nztabposition="right" class="ant-tabs fb-teacher-introductions-container ant-tabs-right ant-tabs-default"><nz-tabs-nav role="tablist" class="ant-tabs-nav ng-star-inserted"><div class="ant-tabs-nav-wrap"><div nztabscrolllist="" class="ant-tabs-nav-list"><div class="ant-tabs-tab ant-tabs-tab-active ng-star-inserted" style="margin-right:;margin-bottom:;"><div role="tab" nztabnavitem="" cdkmonitorelementfocus="" class="ant-tabs-tab-btn" tabindex="0" aria-disabled="false" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="nz-tabs-363413-tab-0"><a _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-title-wrapper selected ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-avatar" style="background-image:url(//nodestatic.fbstatic.cn/pan/downloads/6d2041526269d79c5e0351830b56a0bf.png);"></div><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-name-wrapper"><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-name">张小龙</div><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-brief">公考申论、面试优质讲师</div></div></a><!----><!----></div></div><div class="ant-tabs-tab ng-star-inserted" style="margin-right:;margin-bottom:;"><div role="tab" nztabnavitem="" cdkmonitorelementfocus="" class="ant-tabs-tab-btn" tabindex="-1" aria-disabled="false" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="nz-tabs-363413-tab-1"><a _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-title-wrapper ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-avatar" style="background-image:url(//nodestatic.fbstatic.cn/pan/downloads/e2e718095aa176a987f49528809aff3f.png);"></div><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-name-wrapper"><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-name">李梦圆</div><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-brief">公考申论、面试主讲</div></div></a><!----><!----></div></div><div class="ant-tabs-tab ng-star-inserted" style="margin-right:;margin-bottom:;"><div role="tab" nztabnavitem="" cdkmonitorelementfocus="" class="ant-tabs-tab-btn" tabindex="-1" aria-disabled="false" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="nz-tabs-363413-tab-2"><a _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-title-wrapper ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-avatar" style="background-image:url(//nodestatic.fbstatic.cn/pan/downloads/b7d47f2b4e76f7a23d5dc61c02e317a6.png);"></div><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-name-wrapper"><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-name">赵晓曦</div><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-brief">言语理解与表达优质讲师</div></div></a><!----><!----></div></div><div class="ant-tabs-tab ng-star-inserted" style="margin-right:;margin-bottom:;"><div role="tab" nztabnavitem="" cdkmonitorelementfocus="" class="ant-tabs-tab-btn" tabindex="-1" aria-disabled="false" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="nz-tabs-363413-tab-3"><a _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-title-wrapper ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-avatar" style="background-image:url(//nodestatic.fbstatic.cn/pan/downloads/e142e4f795b91d50da88c8ab9acd2429.png);"></div><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-name-wrapper"><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-name">郭熙</div><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-brief">言语理解与表达、面试讲师</div></div></a><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><div nz-tabs-ink-bar="" class="ant-tabs-ink-bar"></div></div></div><nz-tab-nav-operation class="ant-tabs-nav-operations ant-tabs-nav-operations-hidden"><button nz-dropdown="" type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" nzoverlayclassname="nz-tabs-dropdown" class="ant-tabs-nav-more ant-dropdown-trigger"><i nz-icon="" nztype="ellipsis" class="anticon anticon-ellipsis"><svg viewBox="64 64 896 896" focusable="false" fill="currentColor" width="1em" height="1em" data-icon="ellipsis" aria-hidden="true" class=""><path d="M176 511a56 56 0 10112 0 56 56 0 10-112 0zm280 0a56 56 0 10112 0 56 56 0 10-112 0zm280 0a56 56 0 10112 0 56 56 0 10-112 0z"></path></svg></i></button><!----><!----><!----></nz-tab-nav-operation><!----></nz-tabs-nav><!----><div class="ant-tabs-content-holder"><div class="ant-tabs-content ant-tabs-content-right" style="margin-left:;margin-right:;"><div nz-tab-body="" class="ant-tabs-tabpane ant-tabs-tabpane-active ng-star-inserted" tabindex="0" aria-hidden="false" style="visibility:;height:;overflow-y:;display:;"><!----><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-content-wrapper ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-info-wrapper"><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-name">张小龙</div><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-evaluation-wrapper"><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-score">好评&nbsp;4.9</div><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-evaluators-wrapper"> 776117 <div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-evaluation-divider"></div> 人评分 </div></div><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-description">      中国职业教育领域领军人物，粉笔教育创始人兼CEO，互联网教育模式创新践行者，申论、面试行业名师，凭借专业知识与独特教学，助力数千万考生成功上岸。
      健康新品牌创立者，搭建“健康科普+优质产品+康养服务”三位一体产业架构，精心打造高性价比产品与服务体系，为大众在追求知识提升与健康生活的道路上提供更切实落地的健康服务方案，以实际行动推动两大行业的发展。</div><a _ngcontent-sc201="" target="_blank" class="fb-teacher-introduction-detail-navigator" href="/page/teacher/4"> 了解详情 <div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-detail-icon"></div></a></div><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-portrait" style="background-image:url(//nodestatic.fbstatic.cn/pan/downloads/9e16ac8aacf60eaf2f35e9b1c1cd5a44.png);"></div></div><!----><!----><!----></div><div nz-tab-body="" class="ant-tabs-tabpane ng-star-inserted" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" style="visibility:;height:;overflow-y:;display:none;"><!----><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-content-wrapper ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-info-wrapper"><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-name">李梦圆</div><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-evaluation-wrapper"><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-score">好评&nbsp;4.9</div><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-evaluators-wrapper"> 1206690 <div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-evaluation-divider"></div> 人评分 </div></div><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-description">粉笔申论面试资深讲师，武汉大学思想教育学士，清华大学马克思主义理论硕士。 
13年公务员考试培训经验，有丰富的基层政府挂职经历，多次参加公务员、人才引进等考试，考场实战经验丰富。曾担任清华大学高校德育中心辅导员；半月谈专栏作家，在《时事政治》等知名杂志发表文章，并出版多本教材专著。授课深入浅出、化繁为简，逻辑清晰、生动有趣、实战性强，广受学员好评。</div><a _ngcontent-sc201="" target="_blank" class="fb-teacher-introduction-detail-navigator" href="/page/teacher/287"> 了解详情 <div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-detail-icon"></div></a></div><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-portrait" style="background-image:url(//nodestatic.fbstatic.cn/pan/downloads/93a1ca09d9069042269c61680222b27a.png);"></div></div><!----><!----><!----></div><div nz-tab-body="" class="ant-tabs-tabpane ng-star-inserted" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" style="visibility:;height:;overflow-y:;display:none;"><!----><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-content-wrapper ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-info-wrapper"><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-name">赵晓曦</div><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-evaluation-wrapper"><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-score">好评&nbsp;4.9</div><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-evaluators-wrapper"> 322342 <div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-evaluation-divider"></div> 人评分 </div></div><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-description">粉笔言语优质教师，211大学文科类博士 
15年公考授课经验，打分人次超25万，学员评分高达4.9分。 
长期从事言语理解与表达的授课和教研工作，功底扎实，耐心负责。对于言语题目、教学思路、授课模式有非常深入的研究和理解，并在教学实践中充分贯彻和体现。授课思路清晰严谨，讲解细致入微，条理清楚，是“极高明而道中庸”的典范。 
粉笔公考笔试教研教学总负责人，组织各类授课研讨会议和教研活动，带领教研师资团队制作《行测5000题》《申论100题》《极致模考卷》《模考80分》等优质图书，深受学员认可。</div><a _ngcontent-sc201="" target="_blank" class="fb-teacher-introduction-detail-navigator" href="/page/teacher/115"> 了解详情 <div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-detail-icon"></div></a></div><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-portrait" style="background-image:url(//nodestatic.fbstatic.cn/pan/downloads/cfc4e9cfc4f12731378b63c6d52cdd07.png);"></div></div><!----><!----><!----></div><div nz-tab-body="" class="ant-tabs-tabpane ng-star-inserted" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" style="visibility:;height:;overflow-y:;display:none;"><!----><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-content-wrapper ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-info-wrapper"><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-name">郭熙</div><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-evaluation-wrapper"><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-score">好评&nbsp;4.9</div><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-evaluators-wrapper"> 1272992 <div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-evaluation-divider"></div> 人评分 </div></div><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-description">粉笔言语优质教师，13年公考授课经验，打分人次超100万，学员评分高达4.9分，被学员亲切地称为“粉笔柯南”。 
专业功底扎实，教学经验丰富，教学方法针对性强，能让学员在短时间内熟练掌握解题技巧。善于引导和启发学员，亦庄亦谐、寓教于乐。</div><a _ngcontent-sc201="" target="_blank" class="fb-teacher-introduction-detail-navigator" href="/page/teacher/733"> 了解详情 <div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-detail-icon"></div></a></div><div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introduction-portrait" style="background-image:url(//nodestatic.fbstatic.cn/pan/downloads/5b15efdd434c70c04b40076d05d1c2af.png);"></div></div><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div></div></nz-tabset><a _ngcontent-sc201="" target="_blank" class="fb-teacher-introductions-more-navigator" href="/page/teacher"> 查看全部 <div _ngcontent-sc201="" class="fb-teacher-introductions-more-icon"></div></a></div></div></fb-teacher-introductions></div></div></div><div _ngcontent-sc210="" class="homepage-footer-wrapper"><div _ngcontent-sc210="" class="homepage-about-fenbi-wrapper"><div _ngcontent-sc210="" class="homepage-about-fenbi-brand-wrapper"><div _ngcontent-sc210="" class="homepage-about-fenbi-logo"></div><div _ngcontent-sc210="" class="homepage-about-fenbi-text-logo"></div><div _ngcontent-sc210="" class="homepage-about-fenbi-slogan">遇见更好的自己</div></div><div _ngcontent-sc210="" class="homepage-about-fenbi-description"><p _ngcontent-sc210="">粉笔成立于2015年，作为中国优秀的非学历职业教育培训服务供应商，致力于通过技术创新提供高品质非学历职业教育及培训服务。</p><p _ngcontent-sc210=""> 粉笔依托互联网技术助力职业教育培训创新，坚持科技先行，通过创新OMO模式，实现线上线下资源整合，为用户提供真正有价值的产品和服务，为推动职业教育行业良性发展做出了积极贡献。“粉笔”已成为中国职业教育培训行业中的知名品牌之一。 </p><p _ngcontent-sc210="">2023年1月9日，粉笔正式在香港联合交易所主板上市，股票代码为2469.HK。2023年6月，粉笔正式进入恒生综合指数成份股，并被获准纳入港股通。</p></div><video _ngcontent-sc210="" poster="https://nodestatic.fbstatic.cn/webtools/png/homepageAboutFenbiVideoPoster-f71cf921.png" src="https://nodestatic.fbstatic.cn/video_qhd/1703666550922.mp4" class="homepage-about-fenbi-video"></video></div></div></div><fb-side-bar _ngcontent-sc210="" _nghost-sc206=""><!----></fb-side-bar><fb-to-top _ngcontent-sc210="" _nghost-sc208=""><!----></fb-to-top><fb-notification-modal _ngcontent-sc210="" _ngh