市场在资源配置中起决定性作用，但市场调节不是万能的，它也存在着一些弱点和缺陷。宏观调控有利于帮助人们克服市场调节的弱点和缺陷，保证市场经济健康有序地发展&q;,&q;digest&q;:&q;D&q;,&q;digestRowInfo&q;:[],&q;tagsList&q;:[],&q;category&q;:0,&q;memberArticle&q;:false,&q;vipLecture&q;:false,&q;announcementArticleInfoRet&q;:{&q;enrollStatus&q;:0,&q;enrollStartTime&q;:0,&q;enrollEndTime&q;:0,&q;recruitNum&q;:0,&q;recruitNumRet&q;:null,&q;positionNum&q;:0,&q;reason&q;:null,&q;matchPositionTag&q;:null,&q;remarkBanner&q;:null,&q;hasGlobalStatistic&q;:false,&q;authorized&q;:false,&q;timeStatus&q;:null,&q;timeStatusInfo&q;:null,&q;registerWebsiteInfo&q;:{&q;websitePurpose&q;:null,&q;websiteName&q;:&q;&q;,&q;url&q;:null},&q;affixInfos&q;:null,&q;selectedExam&q;:false,&q;inHotQuery&q;:false,&q;sourceInfo&q;:null,&q;contactInfos&q;:null,&q;digestRemark&q;:null,&q;collectionChildrenNum&q;:0,&q;collectionChildrenUpdateTime&q;:0,&q;companyId&q;:0},&q;enrollStatus&q;:0,&q;enrollStartTime&q;:0,&q;enrollEndTime&q;:0,&q;memberArticleInfoRet&q;:{&q;memberTypes&q;:null},&q;likedUsers&q;:null,&q;relatedObject&q;:null,&q;relatedAds&q;:[],&q;rollingBanners&q;:null,&q;articleTaskStatus&q;:-1,&q;floatBanner&q;:null,&q;experienceTagList&q;:[],&q;morningReadingSpeakerTimeAudio&q;:null,&q;adBanner&q;:null},{&q;id&q;:440989009867776,&q;title&q;:&q;事业单位岗位、合同知多少&q;,&q;source&q;:&q;三支一扶小讲堂&q;,&q;issueTime&q;:1723107280442,&q;updateTime&q;:1773326415527,&q;favoriteTime&q;:-1,&q;favoriteNum&q;:122,&q;contentType&q;:1,&q;businessType&q;:4,&q;contentURL&q;:&q;https://hera-webapp.fenbi.com/api/article/detail?id=440989009867776&q;,&q;cardType&q;:3,&q;visitors&q;:20364,&q;score&q;:440989009867776,&q;imgURLs&q;:[&q;https://hera.fbstatic.cn/440988938089472.jpg&q;],&q;highlights&q;:[],&q;video&q;:null,&q;audio&q;:null,&q;extendInfo&q;:{&q;from&q;:2,&q;reqId&q;:-1},&q;commentNum&q;:164,&q;likeNum&q;:50,&q;sourceInfo&q;:{&q;id&q;:192,&q;name&q;:&q;三支一扶小讲堂&q;,&q;icon&q;:&q;https://hera.fbstatic.cn/default_icon.png&q;,&q;interest&q;:false,&q;interestNum&q;:0,&q;score&q;:0,&q;articleNum&q;:0},&q;showType&q;:0,&q;isLike&q;:0,&q;isFavor&q;:0,&q;preface&q;:&q;大家未来都是要进入事业单位工作的，那势必得要掌握一些事业单位的相关知识。今天小粉笔就带领大家了解关于事业单位的岗位以及聘用合同相关的知识。这可不光是咱们考试的考点，还和大家上岸以后的工作生活密切相关哟&q;,&q;digest&q;:&q;D&q;,&q;digestRowInfo&q;:[],&q;tagsList&q;:[],&q;category&q;:0,&q;memberArticle&q;:false,&q;vipLecture&q;:false,&q;announcementArticleInfoRet&q;:{&q;enrollStatus&q;:0,&q;enrollStartTime&q;:0,&q;enrollEndTime&q;:0,&q;recruitNum&q;:0,&q;recruitNumRet&q;:null,&q;positionNum&q;:0,&q;reason&q;:null,&q;matchPositionTag&q;:null,&q;remarkBanner&q;:null,&q;hasGlobalStatistic&q;:false,&q;authorized&q;:false,&q;timeStatus&q;:null,&q;timeStatusInfo&q;:null,&q;registerWebsiteInfo&q;:{&q;websitePurpose&q;:null,&q;websiteName&q;:&q;&q;,&q;url&q;:null},&q;affixInfos&q;:null,&q;selectedExam&q;:false,&q;inHotQuery&q;:false,&q;sourceInfo&q;:null,&q;contactInfos&q;:null,&q;digestRemark&q;:null,&q;collectionChildrenNum&q;:0,&q;collectionChildrenUpdateTime&q;:0,&q;companyId&q;:0},&q;enrollStatus&q;:0,&q;enrollStartTime&q;:0,&q;enrollEndTime&q;:0,&q;memberArticleInfoRet&q;:{&q;memberTypes&q;:null},&q;likedUsers&q;:null,&q;relatedObject&q;:null,&q;relatedAds&q;:[],&q;rollingBanners&q;:null,&q;articleTaskStatus&q;:-1,&q;floatBanner&q;:null,&q;experienceTagList&q;:[],&q;morningReadingSpeakerTimeAudio&q;:null,&q;adBanner&q;:null},{&q;id&q;:440990290180096,&q;title&q;:&q;中国航天的11个“第一次”&q;,&q;source&q;:&q;三支一扶小讲堂&q;,&q;issueTime&q;:1723107252846,&q;updateTime&q;:1749258857641,&q;favoriteTime&q;:-1,&q;favoriteNum&q;:337,&q;contentType&q;:1,&q;businessType&q;:4,&q;contentURL&q;:&q;https://hera-webapp.fenbi.com/api/article/detail?id=440990290180096&q;,&q;cardType&q;:3,&q;visitors&q;:18443,&q;score&q;:440990290180096,&q;imgURLs&q;:[&q;https://hera.fbstatic.cn/440990259296256.jpg&q;],&q;highlights&q;:[],&q;video&q;:null,&q;audio&q;:null,&q;extendInfo&q;:{&q;from&q;:2,&q;reqId&q;:-1},&q;commentNum&q;:187,&q;likeNum&q;:91,&q;sourceInfo&q;:{&q;id&q;:192,&q;name&q;:&q;三支一扶小讲堂&q;,&q;icon&q;:&q;https://hera.fbstatic.cn/default_icon.png&q;,&q;interest&q;:false,&q;interestNum&q;:0,&q;score&q;:0,&q;articleNum&q;:0},&q;showType&q;:0,&q;isLike&q;:0,&q;isFavor&q;:0,&q;preface&q;:&q;我国的航天事业自起步以来，经历了无数个“第一次”，让我们一起来回顾吧：1.第一颗卫星成功发射1970年4月24日，”东方红一号“人造卫星在甘肃酒泉卫星发射中心成功发射，这是中国发射的第一颗人造卫星，为&q;,&q;digest&q;:&q;D&q;,&q;digestRowInfo&q;:[],&q;tagsList&q;:[],&q;category&q;:0,&q;memberArticle&q;:false,&q;vipLecture&q;:false,&q;announcementArticleInfoRet&q;:{&q;enrollStatus&q;:0,&q;enrollStartTime&q;:0,&q;enrollEndTime&q;:0,&q;recruitNum&q;:0,&q;recruitNumRet&q;:null,&q;positionNum&q;:0,&q;reason&q;:null,&q;matchPositionTag&q;:null,&q;remarkBanner&q;:null,&q;hasGlobalStatistic&q;:false,&q;authorized&q;:false,&q;timeStatus&q;:null,&q;timeStatusInfo&q;:null,&q;registerWebsiteInfo&q;:{&q;websitePurpose&q;:null,&q;websiteName&q;:&q;&q;,&q;url&q;:null},&q;affixInfos&q;:null,&q;selectedExam&q;:false,&q;inHotQuery&q;:false,&q;sourceInfo&q;:null,&q;contactInfos&q;:null,&q;digestRemark&q;:null,&q;collectionChildrenNum&q;:0,&q;collectionChildrenUpdateTime&q;:0,&q;companyId&q;:0},&q;enrollStatus&q;:0,&q;enrollStartTime&q;:0,&q;enrollEndTime&q;:0,&q;memberArticleInfoRet&q;:{&q;memberTypes&q;:null},&q;likedUsers&q;:null,&q;relatedObject&q;:null,&q;relatedAds&q;:[],&q;rollingBanners&q;:null,&q;articleTaskStatus&q;:-1,&q;floatBanner&q;:null,&q;experienceTagList&q;:[],&q;morningReadingSpeakerTimeAudio&q;:null,&q;adBanner&q;:null},{&q;id&q;:441012857893888,&q;title&q;:&q;中国古代重要战争&q;,&q;source&q;:&q;三支一扶小讲堂&q;,&q;issueTime&q;:1723107248132,&q;updateTime&q;:1765853931062,&q;favoriteTime&q;:-1,&q;favoriteNum&q;:335,&q;contentType&q;:1,&q;businessType&q;:4,&q;contentURL&q;:&q;https://hera-webapp.fenbi.com/api/article/detail?id=441012857893888&q;,&q;cardType&q;:3,&q;visitors&q;:27691,&q;score&q;:441012857893888,&q;imgURLs&q;:[&q;https://hera.fbstatic.cn/441012754397184.jpg&q;],&q;highlights&q;:[],&q;video&q;:null,&q;audio&q;:null,&q;extendInfo&q;:{&q;from&q;:2,&q;reqId&q;:-1},&q;commentNum&q;:208,&q;likeNum&q;:88,&q;sourceInfo&q