e&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;公考热点30分：从人民日报六评“西贝事件”看网络舆情应对&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1770472800000,&q;endTime&q;:1770474600000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:805,&q;userId&q;:2010085,&q;name&q;:&q;林夏&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔面试优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;       粉笔面试优质教师。\n       实战经验丰富，多次参加省直、市直公考及遴选并进入面试。2016年从事公考、遴选面试授课工作，授课贴近公务员实务，思路清晰、风格活泼，擅于帮助学员梳理答题逻辑，构建答题框架，丰富答题内容，并给出针对性答题指导。\n       粉笔面试教研教学团队成员。 受邀参与国省考面试真题解析撰写，并收录粉笔面试题库。多次参加粉笔面试授课研讨会议和教研活动，全面把握公考面试命题趋势及最新考情，分享授课经验心得，助力粉笔面试理论研发升级。受邀参与粉笔真题课、专项课、热点课等面试大课的授课。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;17186430fa07716.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:805,&q;episodeCount&q;:557,&q;scoreCount&q;:5431,&q;avgScore&q;:9.86300865402322,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.93,&q;updateTime&q;:1773579390947},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/7992fb303270835014228414410/ihPA6AgtHqUA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=5bf591d2defa824a2afd5735eb00c286&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:3170,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;765643&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11646186,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSig