&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11583878,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;mianshi&q;,&q;courseId&q;:19,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;公考热点30分：“画马”路线被叫停，读懂城市治理的温情&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1769868000000,&q;endTime&q;:1769869800000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:701,&q;userId&q;:40543470,&q;name&q;:&q;姜楠&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔面试优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;       粉笔面试优质教师。\n       2016从事公考教学工作，面试经验丰富，熟知面试理论和技巧，授课耐心细致，对学生擅长个性化教学，引导学生开阔思维，能够因材施教帮助学生挖掘自身特长，从容应对面试。\n       粉笔面试教研教学团队成员。受邀参与命制面试模拟预测题目，国省考面试真题解析撰写，并收录至粉笔面试题库。受邀录制面试真题示范答题，并在粉笔题库进行展示。受邀参与《粉笔晨读》等图书编辑撰写工作。多次参与粉笔组织的各类授课研讨会议和面试教研活动，共同助力粉笔面试理论的研发与升级。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;171860ac97901c7.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:701,&q;episodeCount&q;:487,&q;scoreCount&q;:30170,&q;avgScore&q;:9.871793172025221,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.94,&q;updateTime&q;:1773381933337},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/35dac4b43270835014227803620/L8nd2yP1PO8A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=89bbf6afa3617370706d73c6ddfa5857&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:2183,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;765643&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11583878,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11517243,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;mianshi&q;,&q;courseId&q;:19,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;公考热点30分：拒绝微短剧“童星梦”&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1769349600000,&q;endTime&q;:1769351400000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:865,&q;userId&q;:37392799,&q;name&q;:&q;程菲&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔公考面试优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;       粉笔面试优质老师。\n       始终以生动有趣、激发学生思维为教学宗旨，课堂氛围轻松融洽，广受学员好评。授课重点突出，能够及时总结拓展，讲解语言通俗易懂。擅长引导学生自主思考，善于根据学生的不同情况和需求，制定合适的教学计划，进行个性化指导，助力学员上岸。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1717beafeb6ab50.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:865,&q;episodeCount&q;:815,&q;scoreCount&q;:49181,&q;avgScore&q;:9.831072975336003,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.92,&q;updateTime&q;:1773620424465},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/3dc414923270835014652217041/ZWqirDjpBC8A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=514bdd00f5985bafec1a8312d5705e84&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:3012,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;765643&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11517243,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11517239,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;mianshi&q;,&q;courseId&q;:19,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;公考热点30分：面对“AI魔改”，不能一笑而过&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1769263200000,&q;endTime&q;:1769265000000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:3184,&q;userId&q;:16570049,&q;name&q;:&q;赵公梓&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔面试优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;       粉笔面试优质教师。\n       2017年从事公考教学工作，授课耐心细致、严谨认真，在给予指导的同时，帮助学生调整心态积极备考。教学注重系统思维，带领学生以清晰的逻辑思路直面问题；授课内容丰富，为学生提供海量答题内容参考；倡导个性化教学，帮助学生短期内形成特色答题风格。\n       粉笔面试教研教学团队成员。受邀参与命制面试模拟预测题目，国省考面试真题解析撰写，并收录至粉笔面试题库；受邀录制面试真题示范答题，并在粉笔题库进行展示；受邀参与《粉笔晨读》等图书编辑撰写工作；多次参与粉笔组织的各类授课研讨会议和面试教研活动，共同助力粉笔面试理论的研发与升级。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;171861d7c8d1831.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:3184,&q;episodeCount&q;:1543,&q;scoreCount&q;:10976,&q;avgScore&q;:9.847485422740515,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.92,&q;updateTime&q;:1773622909183},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/702e6d723270835014228008314/AU0Hkzm5lf8A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=2085272ea9e042a7ec8e7019cfef691e&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:3571,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;765643&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11517239,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11492645,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;mianshi&q;,&q;courseId&q;:19,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;公考热点30分：劈柴基地走红&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1768744800000,&q;endTime&q;:1768746600000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:2535,&q;userId&q;:42456882,&q;name&q;:&q;张闻雨&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔面试优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;       粉笔面试优质教师。\n       曾在国、省考试面试中取得全场第一的成绩，面试、演讲、解说、主持等实战经验丰富；曾有过多岗锻炼的经历，机关工作经验丰富；2017年参与公考培训工作，多位带培学员取得了面试第一的好成绩；面试理论功底扎实，熟悉各类面试考试形式；擅长于思维引导，注重因材施教，善于主动发现和解决学员个性化问题。\n       粉笔面试教研教学团队成员。助力粉笔面试理论研发升级。受邀参与模拟题讲解及示范录制500余道，并收录至粉笔面试题库。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;171860167ed58f5.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:2535,&q;episodeCount&q;:454,&q;scoreCount&q;:8684,&q;avgScore&q;:9.803546752648547,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.9,&q;updateTime&q;:1773495126081},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/2c8729cd3270835014227405210/OVgm7btgjzAA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=6023ecad873cbc1c629c268519587820&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:3702,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;765643&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11492645,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11492503,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;mianshi&q;,&q;courseId&q;:19,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;公考热点30分：从晚会“羽绒服登台”看务实新风&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1768658400000,&q;endTime&q;:1768660200000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:859,&q;userId&q;:29155757,&q;name&q;:&q;安悦心&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔面试优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;       粉笔面试优质教师。\n       多年公考一线授课经验，授课风格活泼，思路清晰，深入浅出，耐心细致，擅长总结面试中的各种方法技巧。注重结合时政热点进行教学，实现理论实践相结合，提倡个性化教学，致力于帮助学员扬长避短，一举夺魁。\n       粉笔面试教研教学团队成员。受邀多次参与命制面试模拟预测题目，解析国省考面试真题，并收录粉笔面试题库。受邀参与录制粉笔智慧教室面试真题示范答题，并在粉笔题库进行展示。受邀参与《粉笔晨读》等粉笔精品图书编辑撰写工作。多次参与粉笔组织的各类授课能提升会议和面试教研活动，共同助力粉笔面试理论的研发与升级。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1718b0b0488d2f6.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:859,&q;episodeCount&q;:1040,&q;scoreCount&q;:19378,&q;avgScore&q;:9.852100319950452,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.93,&q;updateTime&q;:1773622357748},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/db8342923270835014226291114/LCTAKY82AdkA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=feecc878df108d966c4ebc42645b751b&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:2847,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;765643&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11492503,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11476637,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;mianshi&q;,&q;courseId&q;:19,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;公考热点30分：深圳“食物银行”，藏着城市怎样的温柔？&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1768140000000,&q;endTime&q;:1768141800000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:1345,&q;userId&q;:42838570,&q;name&q;:&q;姜雨晴&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔面试优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;       粉笔面试优质教师。\n       法学硕士，2016年从事公考培训工作，所带学生涵盖国考、省考、事业单位、三支一扶、人民银行等各类公考领域。授课耐心、细致，善于针对不同考生特点针对性进行点评并给出备考策略。授课不仅局限于具体题目讲解，还善于帮学生总结归纳知识点，输出大量“干货”，助力学生一举成“公”。\n       粉笔面试教研教学团队成员。受邀参与命制面试模拟预测题目，并收录粉笔面试题库。受邀参与录制粉笔智慧教室面试真题示范答题，并在粉笔题库进行展示。参加粉笔面试授课研讨会议共计8次，全面把握公考面试命题趋势及最新考情，积累丰富面试知识，多次参加粉笔面试教研活动，与其他老师分享授课经验心得，助力粉笔面试理论研发升级。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1554cb67bd4e4c2.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:1345,&q;episodeCount&q;:1540,&q;scoreCount&q;:4033,&q;avgScore&q;:9.922142325812061,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.96,&q;updateTime&q;:1773587791155},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/2f7fcce23270835014227596652/sMhNjgtIkJoA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=9e751ed67a7ca9baed5687a42b2282bc&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:3778,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;765643&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11476637,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11476634,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;mianshi&q;,&q;courseId&q;:19,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;公考热点30分：山海寻梦，不觉其远；前路迢迢，阔步而行&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1768053600000,&q;endTime&q;:1768055400000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:437,&q;userId&q;:6799535,&q;name&q;:&q;宋筝&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔面试优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;       粉笔面试优质教师。\n       2015年从事公考培训工作。昔日省级辩论赛最佳辩手，如今公考面试赛道引路人。精通面试理论，帮助学生迅速夯实基础；答题嗅觉敏锐，精准发掘学生个性化问题；表达幽默风趣，谈笑间大量输出知识与技巧；善与他人共情，做你逐梦路上撕开黑夜的那一盏路灯。\n       粉笔面试教研教学团队成员。受邀参与命制面试模拟预测题目，国省考面试真题解析撰写，并收录至粉笔面试题库；受邀录制面试真题示范答题，并在粉笔题库进行展示；多次参与粉笔组织的各类授课研讨会议和面试教研活动，共同助力粉笔面试理论的研发与升级。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;171862f2210547c.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:437,&q;episodeCount&q;:605,&q;scoreCount&q;:16178,&q;avgScore&q;:9.886636172580051,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.94,&q;updateTime&q;:1773385695041},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/2d27d9783270835014227491342/ltemQqMrSwAA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=525165ac51efdc8d5307625873e6d2f0&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:3550,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;765643&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11476634,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11449672,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;mianshi&q;,&q;courseId&q;:19,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;公考热点30分：法官直播卖螃蟹啦！&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1767535200000,&q;endTime&q;:1767537000000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:1726,&q;userId&q;:43851792,&q;name&q;:&q;林夕雅&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔公考笔试优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;         粉笔笔试优质老师。\n        心思细腻，能敏锐的感知学员的心理变化，缓解备考压力与焦虑，授课风格亲切自然、娓娓道来，善于与学员在平等、协作、和谐的气氛下，进行双向交流，帮助学员吸收理解知识。老师在授课中不仅注重理论方法的讲解，还注重提升学员的语言表达能力、思维逻辑能力等，全面帮助学员进步。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1727916afe93029.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:1726,&q;episodeCount&q;:3431,&q;scoreCount&q;:20179,&q;avgScore&q;:9.844590911343488,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.92,&q;updateTime&q;:1773570294202},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:null,&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:2421,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;765643&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11449672,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11449665,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;mianshi&q;,&q;courseId&q;:19,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;公考热点30分：别让网络烂梗“梗”住青少年成长&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1767448800000,&q;endTime&q;:1767450600000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:1160,&q;userId&q;:31473049,&q;name&q;:&q;聂潇乐&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔面试优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;       粉笔面试优质教师。\n       985院校硕士研究生，公考授课经验丰富。性格积极乐观、热情开朗，具有较强责任心。讲课风格严谨认真、春风话语，授课过程感情饱满、诙谐幽默，能够做到因材施教、因人施策。\n       粉笔面试教研教学团队成员。 多次参与粉笔组织的各类授课研讨会议和面试教研活动，共同助力粉笔面试理论的研发与升级。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;17185bbab8dc221.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:1160,&q;episodeCount&q;:649,&q;scoreCount&q;:14648,&q;avgScore&q;:9.842572364827962,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.92,&q;updateTime&q;:1772703325826},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/e4b603c13270835014226675843/1aGgBIay9kAA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=2d125f5bea58552f5c168d6cbed487cf&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:2757,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;765643&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11449665,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11435398,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;mianshi&q;,&q;courseId&q;:19,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;公考热点30分：最忙“五人组”，最近忙啥呢？&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1766930400000,&q;endTime&q;:1766932200000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:1850,&q;userId&q;:44304932,&q;name&q;:&q;靖一然&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔面试优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;       粉笔面试优质教师。\n       2016年从事公考面试授课工作，熟悉机关工作方式，有较强的综合文字功底。法学硕士背景，培养了缜密的逻辑思维能力；曾具有党务工作经验，对于理论把握更为系统、全面。精通结构化面试、结构化小组面试、无领导小组讨论等面试技巧。\n       粉笔面试教研教学团队成员。受邀参与命制面试模拟预测题目，并收录粉笔面试题库。多次参与粉笔组织的各类授课能力提升会议和面试教研活动，共同助力粉笔面试理论的研发与升级。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1718103d5e80725.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:1850,&q;episodeCount&q;:920,&q;scoreCount&q;:19471,&q;avgScore&q;:9.900159211134515,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.95,&q;updateTime&q;:1773564928943},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/2cbfa4fa3270835014227439225/HSzSpVPg61MA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=1fb304db7af80ea8e8c5e7ba8c6f0dd4&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:2547,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;765643&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11435398,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11435385,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;mianshi&q;,&q;courseId&q;:19,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;公考热点30分：让无堂食外卖做好“放心饭”&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1766844000000,&q;endTime&q;:1766845800000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:2535,&q;userId&q;:42456882,&q;name&q;:&q;张闻雨&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔面试优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;       粉笔面试优质教师。\n       曾在国、省考试面试中取得全场第一的成绩，面试、演讲、解说、主持等实战经验丰富；曾有过多岗锻炼的经历，机关工作经验丰富；2017年参与公考培训工作，多位带培学员取得了面试第一的好成绩；面试理论功底扎实，熟悉各类面试考试形式；擅长于思维引导，注重因材施教，善于主动发现和解决学员个性化问题。\n       粉笔面试教研教学团队成员。助力粉笔面试理论研发升级。受邀参与模拟题讲解及示范录制500余道，并收录至粉笔面试题库。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;171860167ed58f5.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:2535,&q;episodeCount&q;:454,&q;scoreCount&q;:8684,&q;avgScore&q;:9.803546752648547,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.9,&q;updateTime&q;:1773495126081},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/2c8729cd3270835014227405210/OVgm7btgjzAA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=6023ecad873cbc1c629c268519587820&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:3651,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;765643&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11435385,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11415188,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;mianshi&q;,&q;courseId&q;:19,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;公考热点30分：雇人回消息的年轻人，到底在“害怕”什么？&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1766325600000,&q;endTime&q;:1766327400000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:859,&q;userId&q;:29155757,&q;name&q;:&q;安悦心&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔面试优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;       粉笔面试优质教师。\n       多年公考一线授课经验，授课风格活泼，思路清晰，深入浅出，耐心细致，擅长总结面试中的各种方法技巧。注重结合时政热点进行教学，实现理论实践相结合，提倡个性化教学，致力于帮助学员扬长避短，一举夺魁。\n       粉笔面试教研教学团队成员。受邀多次参与命制面试模拟预测题目，解析国省考面试真题，并收录粉笔面试题库。受邀参与录制粉笔智慧教室面试真题示范答题，并在粉笔题库进行展示。受邀参与《粉笔晨读》等粉笔精品图书编辑撰写工作。多次参与粉笔组织的各类授课能提升会议和面试教研活动，共同助力粉笔面试理论的研发与升级。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1718b0b0488d2f6.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:859,&q;episodeCount&q;:1040,&q;scoreCount&q;:19378,&q;avgScore&q;:9.852100319950452,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.93,&q;updateTime&q;:1773622357748},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/db8342923270835014226291114/LCTAKY82AdkA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=feecc878df108d966c4ebc42645b751b&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:3192,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;765643&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11415188,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11415021,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;mianshi&q;,&q;courseId&q;:19,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;公考热点30分：“自媒体”医疗科普，显而易见的好与隐蔽角落的恶&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1766239200000,&q;endTime&q;:1766241000000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:865,&q;userId&q;:37392799,&q;name&q;:&q;程菲&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔公考面试优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;       粉笔面试优质老师。\n       始终以生动有趣、激发学生思维为教学宗旨，课堂氛围轻松融洽，广受学员好评。授课重点突出，能够及时总结拓展，讲解语言通俗易懂。擅长引导学生自主思考，善于根据学生的不同情况和需求，制定合适的教学计划，进行个性化指导，助力学员上岸。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1717beafeb6ab50.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:865,&q;episodeCount&q;:815,&q;scoreCount&q;:49181,&q;avgScore&q;:9.831072975336003,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.92,&q;updateTime&q;:1773620424465},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/3dc414923270835014652217041/ZWqirDjpBC8A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=514bdd00f5985bafec1a8312d5705e84&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:3075,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;765643&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11415021,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11392893,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;mianshi&q;,&q;courseId&q;:19,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;公考热点30分：别让“记录”变冒犯——凉山列车的镜头霸凌&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1765720800000,&q;endTime&q;:1765722600000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:56542,&q;userId&q;:106302662,&q;name&q;:&q;宋嘉莉&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔面试优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔面试优质教师。\n有过基层公职机关工作经验，了解机关单位的制度流程，能帮助学员建立起政府思维。曾担任某央企公司的HR，熟悉选用人原则，为学员上岸保驾护航。5年公考教学经验。曾经创造过100%通过率带班，授课人次超过2000人，带培时长超过2000小时，授课学员曾经取得考场第一的好成绩。授课中注重提升学员的语言表达能力、思维逻辑能力。注重干货分享和答题技巧的总结，注重“反模板”教学，通过一对一个性化点评指导，帮助学员挖掘自身优势特点，形成独有亮点。\n粉笔面试教研教学团队成员，参与粉笔多省教学研发工作。受邀参与录制粉笔智慧教室面试真题示范答题30道，并在粉笔题库进行展示。参与撰写28篇内部教研备课材料，在粉笔面试教师。内部进行共享。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;19863fc3c2e54f2.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:56542,&q;episodeCount&q;:672,&q;scoreCount&q;:2123,&q;avgScore&q;:9.929345266132835,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.96,&q;updateTime&q;:1773131698483},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/77db24e21397757888317992195/3ha2BcnWkA0A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=f78aa3c0dbb8252c28884a5e6a8c100a&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:2428,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;765643&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11392893,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11392879,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;mianshi&q;,&q;courseId&q;:19,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;公考热点30分：外卖进了村，如何扎下根&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1765634400000,&q;endTime&q;:1765636200000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:701,&q;userId&q;:40543470,&q;name&q;:&q;姜楠&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔面试优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;       粉笔面试优质教师。\n       2016从事公考教学工作，面试经验丰富，熟知面试理论和技巧，授课耐心细致，对学生擅长个性化教学，引导学生开阔思维，能够因材施教帮助学生挖掘自身特长，从容应对面试。\n       粉笔面试教研教学团队成员。受邀参与命制面试模拟预测题目，国省考面试真题解析撰写，并收录至粉笔面试题库。受邀录制面试真题示范答题，并在粉笔题库进行展示。受邀参与《粉笔晨读》等图书编辑撰写工作。多次参与粉笔组织的各类授课研讨会议和面试教研活动，共同助力粉笔面试理论的研发与升级。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;171860ac97901c7.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:701,&q;episodeCount&q;:487,&q;scoreCount&q;:30170,&q;avgScore&q;:9.871793172025221,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.94,&q;updateTime&q;:1773381933337},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/35dac4b43270835014227803620/L8nd2yP1PO8A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=89bbf6afa3617370706d73c6ddfa5857&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:2354,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;765643&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11392879,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11372603,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;mianshi&q;,&q;courseId&q;:19,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;公考热点30分：东北虎“小独苗”悄然离世，云公益更需公开透明&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1765116000000,&q;endTime&q;:1765117800000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:420,&q;userId&q;:6389623,&q;name&q;:&q;杨一帆&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔面试优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;       粉笔面试优质教师。\n       曾在省级公考面试中取得86.3分成绩，面试、综合成绩全场第一，实战经验丰富。2015年起从事公考面试教学工作，所教授的百余位“上岸”学员涵盖了国考各系统、各省市地方公务员、事业单位、人才引进等领域，创造了国考某部门线上面试精品班学员“全员上岸”的优异成绩。面试授课中用心用情用力，不仅在课程中注重全面清晰讲解各大题型、重点题目，而且更能认真结合学员个人特点，进行个性化点评授课、教授精细化提升建议；同时注重面试学习“传道授业”原则，既从“术”上介绍实用答题技巧，又在“道”上分享面试思路、公考思维、乃至于公职经验，是您面试备考的良师益友，助您“上岸”路上奋楫扬帆！\n       粉笔面试教研教学团队成员。受邀长期参与命制面试模拟预测题目、国省考真题解析撰写，并收录粉笔面试题库。受邀录制面试真题示范答题，并在粉笔题库展示。曾参与粉笔相关图书编辑撰写工作。长期组织参与粉笔面试教研活动，与其他老师分享授课经验心得，助力粉笔面试理论研发升级。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;171810d4f5a3c66.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:420,&q;episodeCount&q;:1053,&q;scoreCount&q;:12854,&q;avgScore&q;:9.77065504901199,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.89,&q;updateTime&q;:1773579199978},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/dfe4b2963270835014226450445/vF9WfMvMgGYA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=5e100b3dab59c950cf7e12098bde49a2&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:3093,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;765643&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11372603,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11372539,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;mianshi&q;,&q;courseId&q;:19,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;公考热点30分：告别“拎马桶”：看懂“人民城市”的绣花功夫&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1765029600000,&q;endTime&q;:1765031400000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:920,&q;userId&q;:39500774,&q;name&q;:&q;喻晓萌&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔面试优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;       粉笔面试优质教师。\n       研究生学历，2016年从事公考培训工作，耐心细致，把握学员个性化特点，对待课程一丝不苟，熟练掌握各种面试作答技巧，善于针对学员自身实际进行针对性讲解，帮助学生快速提高。\n       粉笔面试教研教学团队成员。受邀参与命制面试模拟预测题目，国省考面试真题解析撰写，并收录至粉笔面试题库；受邀录制面试真题示范答题，并在粉笔题库进行展示；受邀参与《粉笔晨读》等图书编辑撰写工作；多次参加粉笔面试授课研讨会议，全面把握公考面试命题趋势及最新考情，积累丰富面试知识。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;17278f01044bc53.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:920,&q;episodeCount&q;:845,&q;scoreCount&q;:48893,&q;avgScore&q;:9.834454829934716,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.92,&q;updateTime&q;:1773621746645},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/2f7d0f623270835014227591684/vT2OcAKITnAA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=fe5de24272ef3e7c40d4dac1267fe226&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:2094,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;765643&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11372539,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false}],&q;episodeCount&q;:32,&q;hasComments&q;:false,&q;individualInfo&q;:{&q;userGroupon&q;:null},&q;paid&q;:false,&q;fillExamInfo&q;:false,&q;payPrice&q;:29,&q;canBuy&q;:true},{&q;