ncil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:10492366,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;言语-【2026国考第14季&a;2025下半年省考第6季】行测模考大赛&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1745665200000,&q;endTime&q;:1745674200000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:5418,&q;userId&q;:57004843,&q;name&q;:&q;王得权&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔言语优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔言语优质教师，9年授课经验，累计授课学员超10万人。课程讲解深入浅出，易于理解。方法和技巧并重，能够让学员学会举一反三，提高备考效率。善于归纳总结，能及时帮助学员梳理知识点和易错点，让大家在备考过程中少走许多弯路。 \n参与组织各类教研工作，曾参与《行测的思维》《笔试系统讲义》《行测5000题》等多个套图书的编写工作，同时参与了多套模拟题的命制和审核工作。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;171ee8c61a66542.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:5418,&q;episodeCount&q;:1247,&q;scoreCount&q;:277061,&q;avgScore&q;:9.83515543508472,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.92,&q;updateTime&q;:1773623450694},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/0f225a083560136621445998641/a18MDSiKuD8A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=37d51c78dbb190aa30426da491044bdf&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:11076,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;710082&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10492366,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:true,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:10492421,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;判断-【2026国考第14季&a;2025下半年省考第6季】行测模考大赛&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1745665200000,&q;endTime&q;:1745676000000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:15984,&q;userId&q;:66492815,&q;name&q;:&q;李宏&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔判断优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔判断优质教师，中国农业大学硕士毕业。 \n已在公考行业深耕5年，累计授课时长超4000小时，直接培训学员逾10万人次。长期专注于公务员考试命题规律研究，对判断推理模块的解题逻辑与应试技巧有独到的理解，擅长将抽象逻辑具象化，复杂考点条理化。注重因材施教，课堂呈现脉络清晰，语言生动风趣，解题技巧实用易掌握，学员提分效果显著。 \n作为核心教研成员连续多年参与粉笔题库建设，参与编撰《决战行测5000题》、《行测思维》等图书。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1774c009210598e.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:15984,&q;episodeCount&q;:1062,&q;scoreCount&q;:72125,&q;avgScore&q;:9.857830155979219,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.93,&q;updateTime&q;:1773622748783},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/4bb439203560136621446284860/xtBZqkpEykYA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=fd8fe2f310790fadd1c5df5f9c647383&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:11502,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;710082&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10492421,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:true,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:10492441,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;数资-【2026国考第14季&a;2025下半年省考第6季】行测模考大赛&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1745665200000,&q;endTime&q;:1745676000000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:2323,&q;userId&q;:31774545,&q;name&q;:&q;程梓&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔数资优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔数资优质教师，211理工科大学硕士毕业。 \n8年授课经验，服务学员众多。专业功底扎实，授课风格严谨又不失幽默。擅于引导学员积极思考，能够让同学们在轻松有趣的氛围里掌握知识点，构建完整的知识框架。是学员公考路上的良师益友。 \n积极参与各类培训活动、线上线下讲义制作及相关图书的编纂工作。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;18d1fd64b1c2dcf.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:2323,&q;episodeCount&q;:981,&q;scoreCount&q;:148614,&q;avgScore&q;:9.776710134980526,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.89,&q;updateTime&q;:1773622167332},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/46c42a7f3560136621446049284/IoTRss2aoNwA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=83ac1184ca9aba5bede57969d7cadf2a&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:11328,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;710082&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10492441,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:f