10760,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;710082&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10492373,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:true,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:10492423,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;判断-【2026国考第16季&a;2025下半年省考第8季】行测模考大赛&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1746961200000,&q;endTime&q;:1746972000000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:7989,&q;userId&q;:57539965,&q;name&q;:&q;沙峰&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔判断优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔判断优质教师。\n8年公考授课经验，从业以来授课人次超5000人，授课时长超10000小时，学员评分高达4.9分。常年从事一线授课工作，担任国省考大班主讲。授课风格轻松诙谐，灵活多变，擅长将复杂的逻辑推理知识转化为生动有趣的案例，让学员在轻松愉快的氛围中掌握解题技巧。注重每位学员的差异化需求，凭借丰富的教学经验精准定位学员薄弱点，提供个性化提升方案。深刻理解公考备考学员的心里压力，不仅是深谙考试精髓的教师。更是众多考生公考路上的引路人和知心朋友。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1927025ae90d1b5.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:7989,&q;episodeCount&q;:1076,&q;scoreCount&q;:34899,&q;avgScore&q;:9.867331442161671,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.93,&q;updateTime&q;:1773560596201},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/0e476ab71397757891882393710/NbDGL7AAu7IA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=e57f2703f6bdfa0f5140fb31ceaa36e0&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:12990,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;710082&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10492423,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:true,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:10492461,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;数资-【2026国考第16季&a;2025下半年省考第8季】行测模考大赛&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1746961200000,&q;endTime&q;:1746972000000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:1650,&q;userId&q;:41404874,&q;name&q;:&q;杜岩&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔数资优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔数资优质教师，985高校毕业。9年公考授课经验，累计授课时长超过10000小时，培训学员超百万人次。擅长数学及资料分析模块。具有深厚理论知识和海量做题经验，实践经验丰富，授课亲切耐心，逻辑思维严谨，能有效的理清学员思路，针对不同类型的学员因材施教。参与组织各类授课教研活动，参与编著《行测的思维》《决战行测5000题》等多套图书。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1794076b312aeeb.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:1650,&q;episodeCount&q;:1529,&q;scoreCount&q;:385901,&q;avgScore&q;:9.836621309610486,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.92,&q;updateTime&q;:177362212