alse,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:10811890,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;判断-【2026国考第26季&a;2025下半年省考第18季】行测模考大赛&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1753009200000,&q;endTime&q;:1753020000000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:1781,&q;userId&q;:43794782,&q;name&q;:&q;甘琳&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔判断优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔判断优质教师，南开大学工科硕士。 \n9年公考授课经验，深入研究公务员考试内容，熟悉考情，授课重点突出、注重干货分享、善于拓展迁移，授课风格亲切自然，引导学生自主思考，活”学“活”用。针对不同基础学员针对性讲解，注重总结实用答题技巧，是广大学员非常喜欢的“琳姐”。 \n参与各类授课研讨会议、教研活动和编制公考适用的图书。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1713dfc3044b6c4.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:1781,&q;episodeCount&q;:1161,&q;scoreCount&q;:492161,&q;avgScore&q;:9.798167672773747,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.9,&q;updateTime&q;:1773591480615},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/5bf74c893560136621446976609/g236Vh0WmLQA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=3ada6f484d67c78cd4894ebf4138ecec&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:10372,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;710082&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10811890,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:true,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:10811891,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;数资-【2026国考第26季&a;2025下半年省考第18季】行测模考大赛&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1753009200000,&q;endTime&q;:1753020000000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:2181,&q;userId&q;:48426564,&q;name&q;:&q;李晟&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔数资优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔数资优质教师，理学硕士。 \n11年一线授课经验，累计授课时常超过10000小时，深入了解公务员考试的命题规律与方向，被学生称为“行走的题库”。授课严谨认真、思路清晰，内容讲解深入浅出，因材施教，能站在学生角度答疑解惑，对学员认真负责。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1721382b6f1e369.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:2181,&q;episodeCount&q;:1501,&q;scoreCount&q;:251706,&q;avgScore&q;:9.833671028898795,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.92,&q;updateTime&q;:1773618351956},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/e9d22a973560136621448410921/CZZ5brVISBMA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=b6438e8f57289ac4aaede8f8cfbc28b0&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:12949,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;710082&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10811891,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q