;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:true,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11251853,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;判断-【2026国考终极模考&a;2025下半年省考第36季】行测模考大赛&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1763895600000,&q;endTime&q;:1763906400000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:1958,&q;userId&q;:16094527,&q;name&q;:&q;程永乐&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔判断优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔判断优质教师，985高校工科硕士。\n10年公考授课经验，打分人次超60万，学员评分高达4.9分，学员口中的“永乐大帝”。\n深谙判断推理出题特点，理论功底扎实，授课思路清晰，耐心细致，风趣幽默。善于从出题思路入手快速破题，深入浅出，注重归纳总结，举一反三。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;196ec50ad55a6e0.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:1958,&q;episodeCount&q;:1573,&q;scoreCount&q;:820068,&q;avgScore&q;:9.86799387367887,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.93,&q;updateTime&q;:1773623069509},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/ea647b293560136621448493397/AgNBj9JryZ0A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=f2afee40504dffe0d47170f69b331867&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:13904,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;710082&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11251853,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:true,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11251854,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;数资-【2026国考终极模考&a;2025下半年省考第36季】行测模考大赛&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1763895600000,&q;endTime&q;:1763906400000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:1191,&q;userId&q;:42494582,&q;name&q;:&q;唐宋&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔数资优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔数资优质教师，985高校毕业。 \n15年公考授课经验，打分人次超70万，学员评分高达4.9分。 \n对数量关系与资料分析有深刻的认识和见解，在授课中注重思维引导，善于剖析学员的解题误区，针对性解决问题，解题方法多样，可操作性强。 \n参与主持各类授课研讨会议和教研活动，负责审阅《行测的思维》等多套图书。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;18d405f7e4b8986.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:1191,&q;episodeCount&q;:1320,&q;scoreCount&q;:782369,&q;avgScore&q;:9.868775475510896,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.93,&q;updateTime&q;:1773622758821},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/9d2164e03560136621447452862/SBy9zjJj7ScA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=0cd0cf017d8689074ec85b58c31ca5af&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:13735,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;710082&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11251854,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:true,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11251860,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;判断-【2025下半年省考第37季】行测模考大赛&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1764759600000,&q;endTime&q;:1764770400000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:4985,&q;userId&q;:49038142,&q;name&q;:&q;王丹娅&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔判断优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔判断优质教师，7年公考授课经验，长期致力于判断推理科目的教学及教研工作，善于拓展迁移，注重总结实用答题技巧。授课严谨细致又不失幽默，注重与学生的互动，擅长解决学员个性化问题，让学员可以在轻松愉快的氛围中得到个性化提升。希望在公考的道路上可以助您一臂之力。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1926fe0983d8fe5.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:4985,&q;episodeCount&q;:1047,&q;scoreCount&q;:168734,&q;avgScore&q;:9.822015717045764,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.91,&q;updateTime&q;:1773617111112},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/4fcec99d3560136621446406348/s1YvcVvNImkA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=d2e4f33d8224f412afae2f9043b0e59e&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:13541,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;710082&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;