资赛后复盘-25下半年省考第37季通用卷&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1764595800000,&q;endTime&q;:1764599400000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:71950,&q;userId&q;:41185252,&q;name&q;:&q;左宏帅&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔数资优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔数资优质教师，浙江大学数学系硕士毕业。\n15年授课经验，累计授课时长超过20000小时，培训师资千余人，培训学员300余万人次，上岸学员数以万计。\n坚持一线教学，不断钻研创新，独创行业资料分析题型教学法，深刻了解学员的痛点难点，授课深入浅出，通俗易懂，因材施教，深受学员好评。\n参与组织各类授课研讨会议和教研活动，著有《行测新时代(数量关系)》《行测新时代(资料分析)》、《公务员考试5100题》等多套图书。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;194401c9dbc8d94.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:71950,&q;episodeCount&q;:306,&q;scoreCount&q;:106865,&q;avgScore&q;:9.8630795863941,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.93,&q;updateTime&q;:1773623430603},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/ef0d2a603560136621448690407/eJ7KKJmF5b8A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=c3fa61877607e1167f9a85a9b29ea6aa&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:5573,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;710082&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11357973,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:true,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11357974,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;判断赛后复盘-25下半年省考第37季通用卷&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1764595800000,&q;endTime&q;:1764599400000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:2751,&q;userId&q;:45636740,&q;name&q;:&q;赵雯雯&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔判断优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔判断优质教师，研究生学历。 \n7年公考授课经验，长期从事判断推理模块的教研和教学工作，培训学员100余万人次，累计评分30余万人次。教学经验丰富，教学思路严谨。知识积累丰富，注重干货分享，带领学员触类旁通，举一反三。性格耐心细致，善于启发学员思考，调动学员积极性。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;172985384e2340f.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:2751,&q;episodeCount&q;:1608,&q;scoreCount&q;:375104,&q;avgScore&q;:9.798434567479958,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.9,&q;updateTime&q;:1773622798908},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/a8b876473560136621447941398/E0VnY2xwtX4A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=2e8dcbb103e86b718886d405098fcb4f&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7584,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;710082&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11357974,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:true,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11358082,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;言语赛后复盘-26上半年省考第1季通用卷&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1765078800000,&q;endTime&q;:1765082400000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:5418,&q;userId&q;:57004843,&q;name&q;:&q;王得权&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔言语优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔言语优质教师，9年授课经验，累计授课学员超10万人。课程讲解深入浅出，易于理解。方法和技巧并重，能够让学员学会举一反三，提高备考效率。善于归纳总结，能及时帮助学员梳理知识点和易错点，让大家在备考过程中少走许多弯路。 \n参与组织各类教研工作，曾参与《行测的思维》《笔试系统讲义》《行测5000题》等多个套图书的编写工作，同时参与了多套模拟题的命制和审核工作。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;171ee8c61a66542.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:5418,&q;episodeCount&q;:1247,&q;scoreCount&q;:277061,&q;avgScore&q;:9.83515543508472,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.92,&q;updateTime&q;:1773623450694},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/0f225a083560136621445998641/a18MDSiKuD8A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=37d51c78dbb190aa30426da491044bdf&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:6651,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;710082&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11358082,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:true,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSale