;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11450482,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;言语-【2026上半年省考第8季&a;2027国考第3季】行测模考大赛&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1769338800000,&q;endTime&q;:1769349600000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:4650,&q;userId&q;:49294864,&q;name&q;:&q;姜然&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔言语优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔言语优质教师。\n8年以上公考培训经验，硕士研究生学历，累计授课时长超9000小时，学员评分高达4.9分。理论功底扎实，深入研究国省考、事业单位等各类笔试考情及命题特色，长期从事精讲、刷题、冲刺等等各阶段课程的教学工作，并长期参与真题解析、模拟题命制、师资培训等各类教研工作。授课逻辑清晰、内容严谨、气氛活泼。善于帮助学生总结方法、拓展思维，全面提升学生的解题能力，深受学员好评。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;192d26d31a437b1.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:4650,&q;episodeCount&q;:1227,&q;scoreCount&q;:34573,&q;avgScore&q;:9.80545512394065,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.9,&q;updateTime&q;:1773583363494},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/43caa7d01397757908836433143/QlBBloizdy4A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=a733a0002b502cecaf8e254010c2e7e4&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:10809,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;710082&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11450482,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:true,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;