;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11705723,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;早课-“铁饭碗”必备守则：公仆的“行为说明书”&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1772492400000,&q;endTime&q;:1772494200000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:6723,&q;userId&q;:61346379,&q;name&q;:&q;狄小汐&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q; 粉笔常识、公安优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;       粉笔常识、公安优质老师。\n       性格耐心细致，善于把握学员个性化特点，因材施教，认真负责，对待课程一丝不苟。讲课生动形象，机智诙谐，听课体验好，学员可以在轻松愉快的氛围中学习，跟着老师节奏主动思考。老师同时注重“反模板”教学，助力学员走出答题模板与误区。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;17133d5e50beccd.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:6723,&q;episodeCount&q;:991,&q;scoreCount&q;:58830,&q;avgScore&q;:9.792180860105388,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.9,&q;updateTime&q;:1773623380488},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:null,&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:2713,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;773251&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11705723,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11705669,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;晚课-热点夜话2&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1772546400000,&q;endTime&q;:1772549100000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:859,&q;userId&q;:29155757,&q;name&q;:&q;安悦心&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔面试优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;       粉笔面试优质教师。\n       多年公考一线授课经验，授课风格活泼，思路清晰，深入浅出，耐心细致，擅长总结面试中的各种方法技巧。注重结合时政热点进行教学，实现理论实践相结合，提倡个性化教学，致力于帮助学员扬长避短，一举夺魁。\n       粉笔面试教研教学团队成员。受邀多次参与命制面试模拟预测题目，解析国省考面试真题，并收录粉笔面试题库。受邀参与录制粉笔智慧教室面试真题示范答题，并在粉笔题库进行展示。受邀参与《粉笔晨读》等粉笔精品图书编辑撰写工作。多次参与粉笔组织的各类授课能提升会议和面试教研活动，共同助力粉笔面试理论的研发与升级。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1718b0b0488d2f6.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:859,&q;episodeCount&q;:1040,&q;scoreCount&q;:19378,&q;avgScore&q;:9.852100319950452,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.93,&q;updateTime&q;:1773622357748},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/db8342923270835014226291114/LCTAKY82AdkA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=feecc878df108d966c4ebc42645b751b&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:2783,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;773251&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11705669,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;suppor