;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11705674,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;晚课-热点夜话3&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1772632800000,&q;endTime&q;:1772635500000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:865,&q;userId&q;:37392799,&q;name&q;:&q;程菲&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔公考面试优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;       粉笔面试优质老师。\n       始终以生动有趣、激发学生思维为教学宗旨，课堂氛围轻松融洽，广受学员好评。授课重点突出，能够及时总结拓展，讲解语言通俗易懂。擅长引导学生自主思考，善于根据学生的不同情况和需求，制定合适的教学计划，进行个性化指导，助力学员上岸。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1717beafeb6ab50.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:865,&q;episodeCount&q;:815,&q;scoreCount&q;:49181,&q;avgScore&q;:9.831072975336003,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.92,&q;updateTime&q;:1773620424465},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/3dc414923270835014652217041/ZWqirDjpBC8A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=514bdd00f5985bafec1a8312d5705e84&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:3556,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;773251&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11705674,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11705763,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;早课-类比常识速记（一）&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1772665200000,&q;endTime&q;:1772667900000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:2751,&q;userId&q;:45636740,&q;name&q;:&q;赵雯雯&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔判断优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔判断优质教师，研究生学历。 \n7年公考授课经验，长期从事判断推理模块的教研和教学工作，培训学员100余万人次，累计评分30余万人次。教学经验丰富，教学思路严谨。知识积累丰富，注重干货分享，带领学员触类旁通，举一反三。性格耐心细致，善于启发学员思考，调动学员积极性。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;172985384e2340f.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:2751,&q;episodeCount&q;:1608,&q;scoreCount&q;:375104,&q;avgScore&q;:9.798434567479958,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.9,&q;updateTime&q;:1773622798908},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/a8b876473560136621447941398/E0VnY2xwtX4A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=2e8dcbb103e86b718886d405098fcb4f&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:3481,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;773251&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11705763,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11705677,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;晚课-热点夜话4&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1772719200000,&q;endTime&q;:1772721900000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:4791,&q;userId&q;:51346254,&q;name&q;:&q;林秋莹&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔面试研究院成员、高级面试讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;8年公考面试授课经验，粉笔大区面试教学教研负责人，主要承担面试各类培训的策划组织、授课培训工作，同时承担国省考各类线上公开课，粉笔培训部项目负责人，获得粉笔”卓越教师”称号。 \n林秋莹老师凭借多年一线授课、培训、研发工作经验，掌握大量的面试方法技巧、干货知识素材与政府思维逻辑，深谙面试作答之道，能够把海量备考内容转化成精简的技巧内容。深入浅出，举一反三答出反套路有深度的内容，让学生高效备考，少走弯路。同时深度结合每位学生的特点，打造个性化，让学员在课堂中展现自我风采，轻松掌握面试。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1720cd00cce8f13.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:4791,&q;episodeCount&q;:826,&q;scoreCount&q;:11458,&q;avgScore&q;:9.864025135276655,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.93,&q;updateTime&q;:1773623280272},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/f6a7f0f73270835013753033481/r57CET8eRCMA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=ba11551c01f5b7967383de833b064957&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:3159,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;773251&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11705677,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11705764,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;早课-申论提分必学好文（一）&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1772751600000,&q;endTime&q;:1772754300000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:3824,&q;userId&q;:40174320,&q;name&q;:&q;江澄&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔申论优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔申论优质教师，曾受邀担任政府机关公文写作培训主讲。8年公考授课经验，打分人次超16万，学员评分高达4.9分。 \n考点把握精准，授课重点突出，善于总结拓展，教学实用性强，能够及时发现学员的个性化问题，因材施教。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1954bf50a3a4e0a.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:3824,&q;episodeCount&q;:1475,&q;scoreCount&q;:235460,&q;avgScore&q;:9.865624734562134,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.93,&q;updateTime&q;:1773620554674},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/98ad3b5b3560136621447282082/3LnOnFkB4YoA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=5fa092dd930dd9ec24f161c367231eed&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:3137,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;773251&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11705764,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11705683,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;晚课-热点夜话5&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1772805600000,&q;endTime&q;:1772808300000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:4432,&q;userId&q;:15393595,&q;name&q;:&q;唐圣楠&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔面试研究院成员、高级面试讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;2年公务员工作经验，7年公考面试授课经验，粉笔卓越教师。\n唐圣楠老师有面试高分实战经历，熟悉政府各项工作。7年来深耕于面试教学一线，线下精品小班和线上千人大课兼顾，从业7年间累计授课人次超过 5000 人，授课时长超过 4000 小时，善于挖掘考生个人优势，突破面试瓶颈。同时是粉笔培训项目负责人，粉笔教学教研团队成员。每年受邀撰写省考面试高频考点和真题解析，主导撰写《真题精练50题》等图书，深度组织参与结构化和结构化小组面试理论的研发升级。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;172984dddabdf3e.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:4432,&q;episodeCount&q;:1180,&q;scoreCount&q;:9935,&q;avgScore&q;:9.871565173628591,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.94,&q;updateTime&q;:1773615380133},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/e79772521397757910063658844/07JN4CCRa7UA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=aadad9d80d32fd5bc0a9f57128cdc699&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:2720,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;773251&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11705683,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11705765,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;早课-政治理论常见词汇（二）&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1773010800000,&q;endTime&q;:1773012600000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:11249,&q;userId&q;:64782764,&q;name&q;:&q;刘烨&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔公基、常识优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔公基、常识优质教师。\n9年一线授课教研经验，累计授课时长超1w小时，学员评分高达4.9分。老师始终以生动有趣、激发学生思维为教学宗旨，善于将课堂内容化繁为简、化难为易，将晦涩知识通过日常生活的案例呈现，使学员在较短时间内能够更清晰地掌握所学知识。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;192d26d6a1107c0.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:11249,&q;episodeCount&q;:861,&q;scoreCount&q;:51878,&q;avgScore&q;:9.866263155865685,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.93,&q;updateTime&q;:1773622237480},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:null,&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:2406,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;773251&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11705765,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11705713,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;晚课-热点夜话6&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1773064800000,&q;endTime&q;:1773067500000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:920,&q;userId&q;:39500774,&q;name&q;:&q;喻晓萌&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔面试优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;       粉笔面试优质教师。\n       研究生学历，2016年从事公考培训工作，耐心细致，把握学员个性化特点，对待课程一丝不苟，熟练掌握各种面试作答技巧，善于针对学员自身实际进行针对性讲解，帮助学生快速提高。\n       粉笔面试教研教学团队成员。受邀参与命制面试模拟预测题目，国省考面试真题解析撰写，并收录至粉笔面试题库；受邀录制面试真题示范答题，并在粉笔题库进行展示；受邀参与《粉笔晨读》等图书编辑撰写工作；多次参加粉笔面试授课研讨会议，全面把握公考面试命题趋势及最新考情，积累丰富面试知识。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;17278f01044bc53.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:920,&q;episodeCount&q;:845,&q;scoreCount&q;:48893,&q;avgScore&q;:9.834454829934716,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.92,&q;updateTime&q;:1773621746645},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/2f7d0f623270835014227591684/vT2OcAKITnAA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=fe5de24272ef3e7c40d4dac1267fe226&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:3297,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;773251&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11705713,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11705766,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;早课-国家“永动机”：用“角色卡”明确职权分工&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1773097200000,&q;endTime&q;:1773099000000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:6723,&q;userId&q;:61346379,&q;name&q;:&q;狄小汐&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q; 粉笔常识、公安优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;       粉笔常识、公安优质老师。\n       性格耐心细致，善于把握学员个性化特点，因材施教，认真负责，对待课程一丝不苟。讲课生动形象，机智诙谐，听课体验好，学员可以在轻松愉快的氛围中学习，跟着老师节奏主动思考。老师同时注重“反模板”教学，助力学员走出答题模板与误区。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;17133d5e50beccd.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:6723,&q;episodeCount&q;:991,&q;scoreCount&q;:58830,&q;avgScore&q;:9.792180860105388,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.9,&q;updateTime&q;:1773623380488},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:null,&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:4049,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;773251&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11705766,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11705721,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;晚课-热点夜话7&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1773151200000,&q;endTime&q;:1773153900000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:4345,&q;userId&q;:49646700,&q;name&q;:&q;马影&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔面试研究院成员、高级面试讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;       7 年公考面试授课经验，粉笔华南大区面试教学教研负责人，主要承担国省考理论大课及各类线上公开课。曾任粉笔面试培训负责人，作为主培训师培训面试师资数千人。 \n       马影老师多年深耕授课一线，面试教学教研经验丰富，授课逻辑清晰，讲解言简意赅，始终相信“复杂的不是问题，而是看问题的眼睛，好老师应该把复杂的知识简单化，而不是把简单的知识复杂化。”&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;171831fc08abd68.png&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:4345,&q;episodeCount&q;:772,&q;scoreCount&q;:27886,&q;avgScore&q;:9.866456286308543,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.93,&q;updateTime&q;:1773621596496},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/2d1f97403270835013757169233/fVNXhL9Rzi8A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=c498a50a2a0932f505e4290200e585b7&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:2993,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;773251&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11705721,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11705767,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;早课-成语登科计划（二）&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1773183600000,&q;endTime&q;:1773186300000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:4631,&q;userId&q;:53050352,&q;name&q;:&q;李玟冰&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔言语优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔言语优质教师，7年公考培训经验，坚信“因材施教、寓教于乐”的教学理念。言语专业功底扎实，授课逻辑清晰，善于引发学生思考，注重课程实用性，对题型有独特的理解，梳理出实用性的言语解题思路，擅长“深入浅出”的授课风格。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;171a64837d3cc60.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:4631,&q;episodeCount&q;:1337,&q;scoreCount&q;:188687,&q;avgScore&q;:9.761679394976884,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.88,&q;updateTime&q;:1773621606522},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/e2d793203560136621448119609/9yfzlYT6RAgA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=9dde19cf86d5d7cc4cd79b97f111aab8&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:3211,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;773251&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11705767,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11705768,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;晚课-热点夜话8&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1773237600000,&q;endTime&q;:1773240300000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:8542,&q;userId&q;:54512012,&q;name&q;:&q;孙瑞芳&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔申论优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔申论优质教师。\n毕业于西北政法大学，长期从事公考培训行业。深谙各类公考信息，能够为学员提供个性化职业建议。授课思路严谨，授课方式严格；能够对学员因材施教，精细辅导，传授专业知识同时，能让学生学会调动自身的知识和想法，善于激发学生学习兴趣，引导学员思考，以专业和严管为学生上岸保驾护航。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;19863fcf5ab9d87.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:8542,&q;episodeCount&q;:1597,&q;scoreCount&q;:1592,&q;avgScore&q;:9.817839195979895,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.91,&q;updateTime&q;:1773622869035},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/c74abe051397757909318601013/9Ohn1OS9r2gA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=592620687a5267acbcba2c61d6e3c31d&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:3413,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;773251&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11705768,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11705769,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;早课-计算能力速成（一）&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1773270000000,&q;endTime&q;:1773272700000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:71950,&q;userId&q;:41185252,&q;name&q;:&q;左宏帅&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔数资优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔数资优质教师，浙江大学数学系硕士毕业。\n15年授课经验，累计授课时长超过20000小时，培训师资千余人，培训学员300余万人次，上岸学员数以万计。\n坚持一线教学，不断钻研创新，独创行业资料分析题型教学法，深刻了解学员的痛点难点，授课深入浅出，通俗易懂，因材施教，深受学员好评。\n参与组织各类授课研讨会议和教研活动，著有《行测新时代(数量关系)》《行测新时代(资料分析)》、《公务员考试5100题》等多套图书。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;194401c9dbc8d94.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:71950,&q;episodeCount&q;:306,&q;scoreCount&q;:106865,&q;avgScore&q;:9.8630795863941,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.93,&q;updateTime&q;:1773623430603},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/ef0d2a603560136621448690407/eJ7KKJmF5b8A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=c3fa61877607e1167f9a85a9b29ea6aa&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:3901,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;773251&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11705769,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11705770,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;晚课-热点夜话9&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1773324000000,&q;endTime&q;:1773326700000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:3184,&q;userId&q;:16570049,&q;name&q;:&q;赵公梓&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔面试优质教师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;       粉笔面试优质教师。\n       2017年从事公考教学工作，授课耐心细致、严谨认真，在给予指导的同时，帮助学生调整心态积极备考。教学注重系统思维，带领学生以清晰的逻辑思路直面问题；授课内容丰富，为学生提供海量答题内容参考；倡导个性化教学，帮助学生短期内形成特色答题风格。\n       粉笔面试教研教学团队成员。受邀参与命制面试模拟预测题目，国省考面试真题解析撰写，并收录至粉笔面试题库；受邀录制面试真题示范答题，并在粉笔题库进行展示；受邀参与《粉笔晨读》等图书编辑撰写工作；多次参与粉笔组织的各类授课研讨会议和面试教研活动，共同助力粉笔面试理论的研发与升级。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;171861d7c8d1831.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:3184,&q;episodeCount&q;:1543,&q;scoreCount&q;:10976,&q;avgScore&q;:9.847485422740515,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.92,&q;updateTime&q;:1773622909183},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/702e6d723270835014228008314/AU0Hkzm5lf8A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=2085272ea9e042a7ec8e7019cfef691e&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:3094,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;773251&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11705770,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;fakeLive&q;:false,&q;one2One&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:false,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:false,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:11705771,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;gwy&q;,&q;courseId&q;:1,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:1,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;: