,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11219119,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:11219122,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【公基法律】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1762056000000,&q;endTime&q;:1762063200000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:28923,&q;userId&q;:80505035,&q;name&q;:&q;林婉华&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质教师，\n具有扎实的理论基础，能够熟练掌握笔试考情和命题趋势，多次参加教研会议，教研成果突出，著有多篇教研文章。\n5年一线教学经验，累计授课时长超千小时，授课经验丰富，语言风趣幽默，授课综合评分4.9，广受学员好评。\n累计督学带班超70个，带班人数逾千人，能够及时回复学员疑问，答疑思路清晰，指导学员发现自己的薄弱项并提出针对性的方法辅助解决问题。善于观察，能够从学员的学习情况中总结出易混易错知识点帮助提升。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1983b2798d5030e.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:28923,&q;episodeCount&q;:609,&q;scoreCount&q;:802,&q;avgScore&q;:9.822942643391526,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.91,&q;updateTime&q;:1773544599718},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/81e6bc0a5145403709537906845/JafPZKk51JwA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=9167ae8a132de87e85e55d782904dc7a&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:8137,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11219122,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:11219136,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【言语】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1762135200000,&q;endTime&q;:1762142400000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:35776,&q;userId&q;:83534698,&q;name&q;:&q;魏兰婷&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师\n拥有7年一线教学授课经验，毕业于双一流院校。深耕言语理解与表达科目，对国考及各省考情有精准把握。具有言语科目丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识。\n①多次参与粉笔授课研讨与教研活动，持续更新教学理论与方法；\n②承担线上公开课及线上直播课等工作，累计全国授课超万人次，学员评分长期稳定在4.9分以上；\n③曾2次在粉笔“师资风采大赛”中入围并获奖，教学能力获得内部认可。\n授课风格耐心细致，善于将复杂的知识点转化为通俗易懂的讲解，营造轻松积极的学习氛围。其高效的解题方法与亲切的指导深受学员好评，是学员信赖的良师。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1984fca9fbd6325.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:35776,&q;episodeCount&q;:610,&q;scoreCount&q;:4222,&q;avgScore&q;:9.801989578398866,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.9,&q;updateTime&q;:1773576447340},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/bcb7f84d5145403709538179593/LKKkDheS6YsA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=ade5c614ffe4fa0bcf0395aa689081c8&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:8134,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11219136,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:11219155,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【公基法律】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1762142400000,&q;endTime&q;:1762149600000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:26000,&q;userId&q;:79045931,&q;name&q;:&q;曾国芳&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔常识公基优质教师。\n5年一线教学授课经验。多次参与粉笔授课研讨会议，具有法律科目丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识，曾参与命制笔试教研和真题解析撰写工作，熟悉常识公基笔试考情。\n累计授课时长1000+，综合评分4.9，授课思路清晰明了，条理分明，能够准确地把握课程的重点，讲解风格流畅自然，语言通俗易懂，注重及时对所学内容进行总结、梳理与回顾，帮助学员巩固所学知识，构建知识框架。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1983b115f298514.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:26000,&q;episodeCount&q;:550,&q;scoreCount&q;:786,&q;avgScore&q;:9.715012722646309,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.86,&q;updateTime&q;:1773579521495},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/62b81e155145403710098214091/A9nD0SODvSgA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=c9496142d0c559efda8f86b4d90a68a7&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:6655,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11219155,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:11222735,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【公基非法】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1762149600000,&q;endTime&q;:1762156800000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:17050,&q;userId&q;:69384227,&q;name&q;:&q;刘枭&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师。\n硕士毕业，从事线上常识公基科目教研授课长达6年，拥有非常丰富扎实的一线授课经验，承担多种产品类型的授课工作。\n教学上，具有常识公基非法科目丰富的实践经验及扎实的专业知识，对常识公基非法考情有着深入的研究，长期承担非法板块小模考授课，曾多次参与命制笔试真题教研和解析撰写工作，致力于研究事业单位的命题规律及答题技巧。\n授课深入浅出，举一反三，善于引导和启发学生；讲课逻辑性强条分缕析，善长归纳方法技巧；从学员角度出发解决问题，长期累计评分达4.9。细致耐心，寓教于乐，善于营造轻松愉悦的课堂氛围，深受学生喜爱。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;17470a2ced5ee4c.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:17050,&q;episodeCount&q;:730,&q;scoreCount&q;:2726,&q;avgScore&q;:9.798972853998558,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.9,&q;updateTime&q;:1773476302738},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/9ae2fc415145403708185095920/NpmeJff4ztMA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=de1c4dfab32e0a94c2ae19673faed255&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7511,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11222735,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:11219183,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【判断】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1762156800000,&q;endTime&q;:1762164000000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:16569,&q;userId&q;:70075243,&q;name&q;:&q;尚美琦&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质教师\n六年一线教学授课经验，曾承担线上+线下精品班、刷题班授课，授课时长3000+小时 具有判断科目丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识，对事业编联考及军队文职考情深入研究 ①撰写多篇事业单位笔试教研材料，在粉笔教师内部进行共享； ②多次参加粉笔授课研讨会议，全面把握事考命题趋势及最新考情，多次参加粉笔教研活动，分享授课经验心得，助力粉笔理论研发升级 累计评分达4.9，细致幽默的讲解风格，让学生在轻松的学习氛围中，用更简单的方法，更通俗的例子解题，深受广大学员的认可和好评；在学员中具有非常好的口碑，是值得信赖的好导师。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;17467e73b22e1a8.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:16569,&q;episodeCount&q;:480,&q;scoreCount&q;:1699,&q;avgScore&q;:9.822248381400826,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.91,&q;updateTime&q;:1773611259167},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/e44a7b0c5145403708868581059/9u4GtiC34EwA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=100de2e81d7376355ed86e067629ba50&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7457,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11219183,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:11219205,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【言语】精选好题 沉浸刷题 &q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1762221600000,&q;endTime&q;:1762228800000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:35776,&q;userId&q;:83534698,&q;name&q;:&q;魏兰婷&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师\n拥有7年一线教学授课经验，毕业于双一流院校。深耕言语理解与表达科目，对国考及各省考情有精准把握。具有言语科目丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识。\n①多次参与粉笔授课研讨与教研活动，持续更新教学理论与方法；\n②承担线上公开课及线上直播课等工作，累计全国授课超万人次，学员评分长期稳定在4.9分以上；\n③曾2次在粉笔“师资风采大赛”中入围并获奖，教学能力获得内部认可。\n授课风格耐心细致，善于将复杂的知识点转化为通俗易懂的讲解，营造轻松积极的学习氛围。其高效的解题方法与亲切的指导深受学员好评，是学员信赖的良师。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1984fca9fbd6325.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:35776,&q;episodeCount&q;:610,&q;scoreCount&q;:4222,&q;avgScore&q;:9.801989578398866,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.9,&q;updateTime&q;:1773576447340},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/bcb7f84d5145403709538179593/LKKkDheS6YsA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=ade5c614ffe4fa0bcf0395aa689081c8&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7526,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11219205,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:11219384,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【综应】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1762228800000,&q;endTime&q;:1762236000000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:17059,&q;userId&q;:67506738,&q;name&q;:&q;李怡辰&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师\n硕士毕业985院校、六年事考授课经验，具有扎实一线教学经验，培训学员上千名。\n扎实的综应科目理论功底，能击破应试重点难点，梳理出实用性的解题思路。\n授课中耐心细致，参与提分营等各类产品授课，重点突出，思路逻辑清晰，能将最专业的知识讲得直白易懂，注重对学员思路的引导，实战性强。 \n多次参加粉笔教研活动，对考情梳理有深入研究，快速帮学员提分。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;17470aeb32cd932.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:17059,&q;episodeCount&q;:491,&q;scoreCount&q;:474,&q;avgScore&q;:9.789029535864975,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.89,&q;updateTime&q;:1773138021859},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/bfd6505e5145403709545092730/laIcdGgauIQA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=7cc318009277acd589537d57f313e812&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7982,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11219384,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:11219394,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【公基非法】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1762236000000,&q;endTime&q;:1762243200000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:16776,&q;userId&q;:73198283,&q;name&q;:&q;王媮&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师\n6年一线教学经验，拥有丰富的线上授课经验。\n在常识公基非法、言语两科目教学方面，负责授课、课程教研、模拟题命制等工作，同时承担常识公基非法和言语两科目的线上公开课，以及线上直播课等工作。积累丰富笔试理论知识\n善于整合梳理琐碎理论，授课方式轻松、逻辑清晰，针对性强，能够帮助学员快速掌握考试内容，高效应对考试。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1746c4a0d51bc94.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:16776,&q;episodeCount&q;:729,&q;scoreCount&q;:1165,&q;avgScore&q;:9.744206008583687,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.87,&q;updateTime&q;:1773582489052},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/71e3e6f01397757888015316660/Ot6GS9zAJqIA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=c773fc7f8cdd4f955379e6633bd2508a&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7508,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11219394,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:11219395,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【判断】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1762243200000,&q;endTime&q;:1762250400000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:16608,&q;userId&q;:69120773,&q;name&q;:&q;熊超&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质教师\n1.6年一线教学授课经验，多年深耕事业单位考试，承担线上多种面试课程，授课经验丰富，逻辑清晰，擅长引导与拓展。\n2.具有丰富的实战经验，考场应试能力突出，专业理论知识系统扎实，对事业单位、军队文职等考情有深入研究:\n①多年参与面试题目真题教研和解析撰写、教研文章等的制作工作，全面了解事业单位考试近年来命题特点以及答题逻辑与技巧;\n②多次参加粉笔授课研讨会，针对面试题目进行深入探讨，多次分享答题经验及授课经验;\n3.学生口碑：风格独特，讲解幽默风趣，同时不失严谨，且擅长引导思考、深入浅出、举一反三、思维发散，以简单的方式激发学员学习热情，快速提高。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1746836fc090a43.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:16608,&q;episodeCount&q;:501,&q;scoreCount&q;:2365,&q;avgScore&q;:9.671881606765316,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.84,&q;updateTime&q;:1773561581097},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:null,&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:9329,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11219395,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:11219396,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【数资】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1762308000000,&q;endTime&q;:1762315200000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:56632,&q;userId&q;:71763689,&q;name&q;:&q;张程&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质教师\n985硕士毕业，深耕事业单位考试，三年一线教学授课经验，实战与授课经验丰富。\n全面了解数量关系和资料分析答题技巧，授课逻辑清晰，教研教学扎实刻苦:\n曾参与笔试真题教研和解析撰写工作;\n注重考场思维，针对学生困惑研究教学策略，授课重点突出，及时总结拓展;\n学生口碑:累计授课超2000小时，累计评分达4.9分，注重启发式引导，课堂氛围轻松融洽，讲解语言通俗易懂。善于根据学生的不同情况和需求，制定合适的教学计划，进行个性化指导，助力学员上岸。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;184e197c2940672.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:56632,&q;episodeCount&q;:353,&q;scoreCount&q;:1032,&q;avgScore&q;:9.899224806201547,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.95,&q;updateTime&q;:1773106304338},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/c5aecd615145403709538523381/FhVtVkaUXp0A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=698fd039e524a09319371f0eda81fd2c&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:8579,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11219396,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:11219707,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【判断】精选好题 沉浸刷题 &q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1762322400000,&q;endTime&q;:1762329600000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:56388,&q;userId&q;:95971831,&q;name&q;:&q;林栗&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质教师\n多年一线教学授课经验，具有判断科目丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识，全面了解事业单位判断推理部分的命题规律及管题技巧，善于结合学员实际情况，对知识点进行针对性讲解，善于通过启发式教学，激发学员自主思考能力，有效帮助学员快速提高。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1985a5de8a9346e.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:56388,&q;episodeCount&q;:290,&q;scoreCount&q;:1061,&q;avgScore&q;:9.877474081055611,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.94,&q;updateTime&q;:1773473571043},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/c81f82965145403714072054931/hyScwfm0Fo8A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=9fe4d91480a427e06131a0f5f04af827&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:9004,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11219707,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:11219709,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【言语】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1762329600000,&q;endTime&q;:1762336800000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:52287,&q;userId&q;:72752112,&q;name&q;:&q;于小雅&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师\n6年一线教学经验，深耕事业单位考试，总授课时长2500+h\n对于言语理解与表达科目有丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识。承担过线上和线下的笔试精品班、刷题班、冲刺班等多种班型。\n教学思路清晰严谨，善于总结；重难点突出，举一反三夯实巩固，深受学员好评。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;19bbc41bac59b83.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:52287,&q;episodeCount&q;:344,&q;scoreCount&q;:1147,&q;avgScore&q;:9.778552746294684,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.89,&q;updateTime&q;:1773483874192},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/82ea83095145403709544757509/SyP20uThTZcA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=41435beb2ad52e1ee5e61334ffdb4056&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:8417,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11219709,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:11219791,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【言语】精选好题 沉浸刷题 &q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1762394400000,&q;endTime&q;:1762401600000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:35776,&q;userId&q;:83534698,&q;name&q;:&q;魏兰婷&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师\n拥有7年一线教学授课经验，毕业于双一流院校。深耕言语理解与表达科目，对国考及各省考情有精准把握。具有言语科目丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识。\n①多次参与粉笔授课研讨与教研活动，持续更新教学理论与方法；\n②承担线上公开课及线上直播课等工作，累计全国授课超万人次，学员评分长期稳定在4.9分以上；\n③曾2次在粉笔“师资风采大赛”中入围并获奖，教学能力获得内部认可。\n授课风格耐心细致，善于将复杂的知识点转化为通俗易懂的讲解，营造轻松积极的学习氛围。其高效的解题方法与亲切的指导深受学员好评，是学员信赖的良师。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1984fca9fbd6325.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:35776,&q;episodeCount&q;:610,&q;scoreCount&q;:4222,&q;avgScore&q;:9.801989578398866,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.9,&q;updateTime&q;:1773576447340},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/bcb7f84d5145403709538179593/LKKkDheS6YsA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=ade5c614ffe4fa0bcf0395aa689081c8&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7335,&q;hasAudition&q;:fal