UA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=15e974fbc21791a1b25433791ff9a66b&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:8418,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11233865,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:11233867,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【公基非法】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1763452800000,&q;endTime&q;:1763460000000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:32758,&q;userId&q;:73286911,&q;name&q;:&q;陆梦媛&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师。\n5年教学经验。具有常识公基非法和综应科目系统扎实的专业理论知识，熟悉各地考情和命题特点。\n授课思路清晰，重点突出，善于用简洁明了的语言讲授知识点，上课氛围轻松愉快。累计授课时常超过2000小时，所带学员超过7000人。\n学生口碑：具有亲切幽默的授课风格，让学生在轻松的学习氛围中用更简单的方法获得知识。有耐心，对于学生的问题能够循循善诱，深受广大学员认可和好评。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1785909ecba60f3.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:32758,&q;episodeCount&q;:631,&q;scoreCount&q;:1268,&q;avgScore&q;:9.686119873817033,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.84,&q;updateTime&q;:1773286316489},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{