00,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:56632,&q;userId&q;:71763689,&q;name&q;:&q;张程&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质教师\n985硕士毕业，深耕事业单位考试，三年一线教学授课经验，实战与授课经验丰富。\n全面了解数量关系和资料分析答题技巧，授课逻辑清晰，教研教学扎实刻苦:\n曾参与笔试真题教研和解析撰写工作;\n注重考场思维，针对学生困惑研究教学策略，授课重点突出，及时总结拓展;\n学生口碑:累计授课超2000小时，累计评分达4.9分，注重启发式引导，课堂氛围轻松融洽，讲解语言通俗易懂。善于根据学生的不同情况和需求，制定合适的教学计划，进行个性化指导，助力学员上岸。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;184e197c2940672.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:56632,&q;episodeCount&q;:353,&q;scoreCount&q;:1032,&q;avgScore&q;:9.899224806201547,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.95,&q;updateTime&q;:1773106304338},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/c5aecd615145403709538523381/FhVtVkaUXp0A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=698fd039e524a09319371f0eda81fd2c&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7918,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11094701,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:11094702,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;pl