&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师\n丰富实战背景：\n拥有超过7年的实战教学经验，总授课时长突破2000小时，见证了无数学生的成长与蜕变。\n深厚专业底蕴与实战融合：\n在公基与言语领域，拥有深厚的学术功底与实战经验，能够深入浅出地剖析考点，直击要害。积极参与多次教研会，紧跟国家公务员及事业单位选拔的最新动态，确保教学内容的前沿性与针对性。\n优质教学风采与广泛认可：\n收获超过1000份来自全国各地学员的热烈好评，构建起坚实的口碑基础。\n以“逻辑严谨、寓教于乐”的独特教学风格著称，擅长运用生动实例与趣味互动，将抽象概念具象化，让学习之旅变得生动有趣，极大提升了学生的学习兴趣与效率。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1760362bb2f7c82.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:15530,&q;episodeCount&q;:449,&q;scoreCount&q;:1212,&q;avgScore&q;:9.900990099009896,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.95,&q;updateTime&q;:1773411447504},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:null,&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:8574,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11000166,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:11000989,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【判断】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1757570400000,&q;endTime&q;:1757577600000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:12512,&q;userId&q;:58005817,&q;name&q;:&q;王红艳&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质教师\n5年一线教学授课经验，具有判断科日丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识多次参加粉笔授课研讨会议，全面把握笔试命题趋势及最新考情，积累丰富笔试知识;多次参加粉笔教研活动，助力粉笔理论研发升级。 具有轻松愉快的授课风格，让学生在轻松的学习氛围中，用更简单的方法，找到更快捷的解题之道，深受广大学员的认可和好评;在学员中具有非常好的口碑，是值得信赖的好老师。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;173282b5ad9bf5d.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:12512,&q;episodeCount&q;:450,&q;scoreCount&q;:1751,&q;avgScore&q;:9.837806967447161,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.92,&q;updateTime&q;:1773544368704},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/1811c8775145403708030729602/DlZftSuVwFEA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=80b23c5d9b327cc41b9292c6620ca934&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7248,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11000989,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:11000999,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【言语】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1757577600000,&q;endTime&q;:1757584800000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:16524,&q;userId&q;:49155632,&q;name&q;:&q;满晓堂&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师\n六年事业单位及公考教学经验，曾备战公考一次成功上岸，以本岗位笔试分数第一、面试第二的成绩顺利通过，原税务局在职公务员。累计授课超过1500小时，累计评分达4.9分。多次参与笔试教研与培训，不断提升，凭借敏锐洞察力与深厚专业素养，对模拟题方向有深刻见解。授课思路清晰，形象生动，擅长理论与实践相结合，举一反三夯实巩固，从而激发学员学习热情和自主意识，让学生在轻松的学习氛围中，用更简单的方法，找到更快捷的解题之道，在学员中具有非常好的口碑。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;17467879686bbe1.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:16524,&q;episodeCount&q;:492,&q;scoreCount&q;:1665,&q;avgScore&q;:9.77537537537537,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.89,&q;updateTime&q;:1773547501096},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/6d42b8e95145403714882953780/wGKek9PMDbkA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=fd2a39d484d775f3acaff1186a7899a6&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7882,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11000999,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:11001002,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【综应】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1757642400000,&q;endTime&q;:1757649600000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:34144,&q;userId&q;:83886683,&q;name&q;:&q;成远&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质教师\n五年一线教学授课经验 具有综应科目丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识，对综应考情深入研究 教学经验：多次积极参加综应科目的教研培训，对各省份综应考情进行深入研究，积累丰富的综应知识 学生口碑：授课风格细腻认真，根据学员的学习风格，灵活调整教学策略，使每位学员都能跟上课堂进度。课堂氛围轻松，能够让学员们积极参与讨论，互相分享自己的见解。与学员之间的互动频繁，学员提出的问题能够及时耐心解答。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;178a5ed9b29baae.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:34144,&q;episodeCount&q;:379,&q;scoreCount&q;:278,&q;avgScore&q;:9.812949640287767,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.91,&q;updateTime&q;:1773283970717},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/dded7c315145403709430054231/MetXyTQDR9MA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=5cfd13ce7c9af3e4a44ad6a7c92fffaa&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7771,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11001002,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;need