霞&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质教师\n5年一线教学授课经验，授课经验丰富。具有综应科目丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识，多次参加粉笔授课研讨会议，专业能力强，具有独特的授课风格，结合学生自身情况因材施教，耐心细致解答学生问题，让学生学有所获。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;178c41303e0e2c5.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:34963,&q;episodeCount&q;:315,&q;scoreCount&q;:325,&q;avgScore&q;:9.729230769230776,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.86,&q;updateTime&q;:1772957940845},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/1bda03c55145403709539904282/4v4nhCA680YA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=84480a4d2ba2069cf8ef3e33bba01ed4&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:9004,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11003469,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:11003470,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【公基法律】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1759024800000,&q;endTime&q;:1759032000000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:26000,&q;userId&q;:79045931,&q;name&q;:&q;曾国芳&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔常识公基优质教师。\n5年一线教学授课经验。多次参与粉笔授课研讨会议，具有法律科目丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识，曾参与命制笔试教研和真题解析撰写工作，熟悉常识公基笔试考情。\n累计授课时长1000+，综合评分4.9，授课思路清晰明了，条理分明，能够准确地把握课程的重点，讲解风格流畅自然，语言通俗易懂，注重及时对所学内容进行总结、梳理与回顾，帮助学员巩固所学知识，构建知识框架。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1983b115f298514.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:26000,&q;episodeCount&q;:550,&q;scoreCount&q;:786,&q;avgScore&q;:9.715012722646309,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.86,&q;updateTime&q;:1773579521495},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/62b81e155145403710098214091/A9nD0SODvSgA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=c9496142d0c559efda8f86b4d90a68a7&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7222,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11003470,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:11003472,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【言语】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1759032000000,&q;endTime&q;:1759039200000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:35776,&q;userId&q;:83534698,&q;name&q;:&q;魏兰婷&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师\n拥有7年一线教学授课经验，毕业于双一流院校。深耕言语理解与表达科目，对国考及各省考情有精准把握。具有言语科目丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识。\n①多次参与粉笔授课研讨与教研活动，持续更新教学理论与方法；\n②承担线上公开课及线上直播课等工作，累计全国授课超万人次，学员评分长期稳定在4.9分以上；\n③曾2次在粉笔“师资风采大赛”中入围并获奖，教学能力获得内部认可。\n授课风格耐心细致，善于将复杂的知识点转化为通俗易懂的讲解，营造轻松积极的学习氛围。其高效的解题方法与亲切的指导深受学员好评，是学员信赖的良师。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1984fca9fbd6325.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:35776,&q;episodeCount&q;:610,&q;scoreCount&q;:4222,&q;avgScore&q;:9.801989578398866,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.9,&q;updateTime&q;:1773576447340},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/bcb7f84d5145403709538179593/LKKkDheS6YsA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=ade5c614ffe4fa0bcf0395aa689081c8&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7939,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11003472,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:11003473,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【公基非法】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1759111200000,&q;endTime&q;:1759118400000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:13526,&q;userId&q;:48601508,&q;name&q;:&q;冯春雨&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔常识公基优质教师\n     六年一线教学授课经验，具有丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识，态度严谨，知识储备深厚，授课思路清晰，风格风趣幽默，善于抓住学员学习薄弱点，因材施教，易于激发学员学习热情，深受广大学员的认可和好评。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1983b565ff03e7b.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:13526,&q;episodeCount&q;:661,&q;scoreCount&q;:5775,&q;avgScore&q;:9.77593073593074,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.89,&q;updateTime&q;:1773240032843},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/5ba385475145403708398283831/7GT7IAU0lBMA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=b9f34bbf2057adc9158f0bcdd0d61937&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7922,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:11003473,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;need