eTime&q;:1773474825913},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/fdb6705d5145403708057169016/DqUnYKBVk6oA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=9c7743818b68419d9335d456f483cb3e&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:8224,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10941549,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10941561,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【判断】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1756432800000,&q;endTime&q;:1756440000000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:16991,&q;userId&q;:46502384,&q;name&q;:&q;岑红&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质教师\n       6年教学授课经验，具有判断科目丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识，参与笔试判断科目模拟题命制和解析审核且多次参加粉笔授课研讨会议，全面了解事业单位判断类题型的命题规律及答题技巧。善于将知识点简单化、条理化和趣味化以激发学生的学习热情，同时授课逻辑性强，思维严谨，能够意识到学生在知识点上的问题并给予相应的指导，深受广大学员的认可和好评。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;19854eea5710183.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:16991,&q;episodeCount&q;:496,&q;scoreCount&q;:2569,&q;avgScore&q;:9.792915531335142,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.9,&q;updateTime&q;:1773604268370},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/10d5dbb55145403709539499496/emXm1Ym9kfIA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=fc844b010265e86e6742934e4dffdd3c&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7607,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10941561,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10941563,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【公基法律】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1756440000000,&q;endTime&q;:1756447200000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:26000,&q;userId&q;:79045931,&q;name&q;:&q;曾国芳&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔常识公基优质教师。\n5年一线教学授课经验。多次参与粉笔授课研讨会议，具有法律科目丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识，曾参与命制笔试教研和真题解析撰写工作，熟悉常识公基笔试考情。\n累计授课时长1000+，综合评分4.9，授课思路清晰明了，条理分明，能够准确地把握课程的重点，讲解风格流畅自然，语言通俗易懂，注重及时对所学内容进行总结、梳理与回顾，帮助学员巩固所学知识，构建知识框架。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1983b115f298514.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:26000,&q;episodeCount&q;:550,&q;scoreCount&q;:786,&q;avgScore&q;:9.715012722646309,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.86,&q;updateTime&q;:1773579521495},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/62b81e155145403710098214091/A9nD0SODvSgA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=c9496142d0c559efda8f86b4d90a68a7&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7091,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10941563,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10941606,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【数资】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1756447200000,&q;endTime&q;:1756454400000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:16892,&q;userId&q;:64000402,&q;name&q;:&q;陈实&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师\n六年教学经验，承担各种班型授课，理论知识扎实，了解事业单位数量关系和资料分析的答题技巧，注重专业知识的传递，授课有亲和力，逻辑性强，能激发学生学习的热情，得到许多学生的好评和喜爱。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;17a757d0def9021.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:16892,&q;episodeCount&q;:366,&q;scoreCount&q;:1043,&q;avgScore&q;:9.892617449664424,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.95,&q;updateTime&q;:1773542090436},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/c851eb6f5145403710133043770/P6pa1nY0NqgA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=560efd01ae975cc0d0456e09500eb8d0&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:8519,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10941606,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10941609,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【公基非法】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1756454400000,&q;endTime&q;:1756461600000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:13526,&q;userId&q;:48601508,&q;name&q;:&q;冯春雨&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔常识公基优质教师\n     六年一线教学授课经验，具有丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识，态度严谨，知识储备深厚，授课思路清晰，风格风趣幽默，善于抓住学员学习薄弱点，因材施教，易于激发学员学习热情，深受广大学员的认可和好评。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1983b565ff03e7b.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:13526,&q;episodeCount&q;:661,&q;scoreCount&q;:5775,&q;avgScore&q;:9.77593073593074,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.89,&q;updateTime&q;:1773240032843},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/5ba385475145403708398283831/7GT7IAU0lBMA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=b9f34bbf2057adc9158f0bcdd0d61937&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:8161,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10941609,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10941210,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【公基非法】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1756519200000,&q;endTime&q;:1756526400000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:34183,&q;userId&q;:83886596,&q;name&q;:&q;赵佳佳&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔常识公基优质讲师\n6年一线教学经验，深耕事业单位考试，承担过笔试精品班、刷题班等多种班型，授课和实战经验丰富。\n\n曾参与真题教研解析工作，教研文章撰写工作，模拟题的教研工作，对最新命题趋势方向有深入研究;\n多次参加粉笔授课研讨会议，注重考场思维，针对学生困惑研究教学策略，深入研讨事考命题趋势及最新考情，注重自我提升，积累丰富笔试理论知识;\n累计授课超1400小时，累计评分达4.9分，善于把握学员个性化特点，因材施教，认真负责，真诚对待每一位学员。讲课生动形象，有代入感，学员可以在轻松愉快的氛围中学习，跟着老师节奏主动思考，学习知识，掌握知识。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1983ba750d61d0b.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:34183,&q;episodeCount&q;:689,&q;scoreCount&q;:1641,&q;avgScore&q;:9.802559414990869,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.9,&q;updateTime&q;:1771456495223},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:null,&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:8548,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10941210,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10941614,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【判断】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1756526400000,&q;endTime&q;:1756533600000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:16718,&q;userId&q;:45061774,&q;name&q;:&q;王霏&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师\n5年公培行业从业经验，判断推理基本功扎实，擅长帮助学生分析问题、总结做题思路和技巧，耐心细致，授课思路清晰。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1746bcb1b6083c9.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:16718,&q;episodeCount&q;:459,&q;scoreCount&q;:1849,&q;avgScore&q;:9.766360194699821,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.88,&q;updateTime&q;:1773457275604},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/d391ebe15145403707386360563/RiraEc3HyGYA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=de75e641b117c04d861c2840d7bcef3f&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7830,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10941614,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10941616,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【公基非法】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1756533600000,&q;endTime&q;:1756540800000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:22805,&q;userId&q;:70647629,&q;name&q;:&q;韩健&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师。从事线上常识公基科目教研授课长达6年，拥有非常丰富扎实的一线授课经验，承担多种产品类型的授课工作。\n教研上，具有非法科目丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识，对常识公基非法考情有着深入的研究，长期承担非法板块小模考授课，曾多次参与命制笔试真题教研和解析撰写工作，致力于研究事业单位的命题规律及答题技巧，并负责非法多科目单题录制工作。\n教学上，教学思路开阔，灵活举一反三，深入浅出，善于引导和启发学生；讲课逻辑性强条分缕析，善长归纳方法技巧；课堂互动性强，善于从学员角度出发解决问题。\n授课风格循循善诱，细致耐心，亲和力强，寓教于乐，课堂氛围轻松有趣无负担，深受学生喜爱，长期累计评分达4.9，广受信赖。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;193af5a8fdca2ae.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:22805,&q;episodeCount&q;:944,&q;scoreCount&q;:2442,&q;avgScore&q;:9.809172809172814,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.9,&q;updateTime&q;:1773565663692},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/c570221f5145403709396241830/189czrPabqQA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=a910a17501a492740f4ece27556c8403&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:8037,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10941616,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10941617,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【言语】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1756605600000,&q;endTime&q;:1756612800000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:16686,&q;userId&q;:69893637,&q;name&q;:&q;刘期期&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师\n毕业于211大学，投身教育事业6年时间，对言语科目有丰富的实践经验，参与真题的解析和模拟题的命制，课程累计评分4.9分。了解考场答题思维及应变技巧，注重启发式授课，让学生在轻松的氛围中找到高效的解题方法。授课风格风趣幽默，课堂互动性强，善于从学员角度出发解决个性化问题，激发学员学习热情和自主意识，注重理论与实践相结合。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1746bbe5d160d43.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:16686,&q;episodeCount&q;:447,&q;scoreCount&q;:2045,&q;avgScore&q;:9.762347188264059,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.88,&q;updateTime&q;:1773546406556},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/077558931397757911915926552/PpFe6z48T8UA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=6bc5b6dbf5223797c9f2083c2bb5bf66&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7696,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10941617,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10941618,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【判断】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1756612800000,&q;endTime&q;:1756620000000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:16569,&q;userId&q;:70075243,&q;name&q;:&q;尚美琦&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质教师\n六年一线教学授课经验，曾承担线上+线下精品班、刷题班授课，授课时长3000+小时 具有判断科目丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识，对事业编联考及军队文职考情深入研究 ①撰写多篇事业单位笔试教研材料，在粉笔教师内部进行共享； ②多次参加粉笔授课研讨会议，全面把握事考命题趋势及最新考情，多次参加粉笔教研活动，分享授课经验心得，助力粉笔理论研发升级 累计评分达4.9，细致幽默的讲解风格，让学生在轻松的学习氛围中，用更简单的方法，更通俗的例子解题，深受广大学员的认可和好评；在学员中具有非常好的口碑，是值得信赖的好导师。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;17467e73b22e1a8.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:16569,&q;episodeCount&q;:480,&q;scoreCount&q;:1699,&q;avgScore&q;:9.822248381400826,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.91,&q;updateTime&q;:1773611259167},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/e44a7b0c5145403708868581059/9u4GtiC34EwA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=100de2e81d7376355ed86e067629ba50&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7374,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10941618,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10843472,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【言语】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1751342400000,&q;endTime&q;:1751349600000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:16948,&q;userId&q;:69316245,&q;name&q;:&q;巨琼&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质教师\n6年以上一线教学授课经验，累计授课时长2000+，授课人数10000+，授课评分4.9分，累计获得学员好评上千条。具有扎实系统的言语专业知识体系且线上线下均授课经验丰富，线上授课涵盖联考、山东、安徽等各省言语课程，线下曾多次担任联考、江苏等省份言语主讲。长期参与言语科目教研工作，真题解析、模拟题撰写、参与《职测3000题》 单题录制等，全面了解事业单位各省份言语命题规律及答题技巧。教学中，曾获事业单位教师风采大赛“三等奖”，持续积极探索生动有趣的教学方式，精准把握言语考点，帮助学员快速理解并掌握言语技巧，能以独特的方法引导学员攻克难关，提升答题准确率与速度，深受学员认可，助力多名学员成功实现自己的职业目标。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1746cf3620ab526.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:16948,&q;episodeCount&q;:595,&q;scoreCount&q;:2018,&q;avgScore&q;:9.865213082259663,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.93,&q;updateTime&q;:1773488367488},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/c5adc5685145403709538521768/r1Y9MG5YjPwA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=e92eaa0857512f99b08ff349fc652a92&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7355,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10843472,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10843502,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【言语】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1751349600000,&q;endTime&q;:1751356800000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:14565,&q;userId&q;:48370970,&q;name&q;:&q;王清悦&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师\n8年一线教学经验，教学风格严谨而不失活泼，善于将复杂的知识点以生动有趣的方式呈现，让学生轻松掌握。对于考试考点有着敏锐的洞察力和精准的把握能力，帮助学生有效备考，事半功倍。我坚信，教育不仅仅是知识的传授，更是思维的启迪与人格的塑造，因此，始终致力于培养学生的独立思考能力与解决问题的能力，助力他们在人生的每一个阶段都能自信前行。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;173d720cea24b6c.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:14565,&q;episodeCount&q;:477,&q;scoreCount&q;:1439,&q;avgScore&q;:9.745656706045871,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.87,&q;updateTime&q;:1773559873082},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/cbd1293d5145403707742801437/WSGdVtt1L3AA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=a446564dcadd70a9b99e6d27e1f0ecde&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:8124,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10843502,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10843503,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【数资】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1751356800000,&q;endTime&q;:1751364000000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:16722,&q;userId&q;:52232168,&q;name&q;:&q;王轶琢&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师\n6年一线教学授课经验；具有数资科目丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识；多次参加粉笔教研活动，分享授课经验心得，助力粉笔理论研发升级；\n累计授课超过2000小时，累计评分达4.9分；授课与实战经验丰富，熟悉考场答题思维及应变技巧。\n老师授课风格：风趣幽默，灵活引导学员自主思考，激发学员学习热情和自主意识；授课逻辑性强，注重理论与实践相结合，深受学员的喜爱。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1983bddcd777cc6.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:16722,&q;episodeCount&q;:870,&q;scoreCount&q;:2527,&q;avgScore&q;:9.784724970320534,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.89,&q;updateTime&q;:1773198754974},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/9ebc23c15145403707375528343/mutMbTelffgA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=fa18dfaff16469d1f41c7e7cebb5b1a6&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7069,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10843503,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10843504,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【言语】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1751421600000,&q;endTime&q;:1751428800000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:16606,&q;userId&q;:72504959,&q;name&q;:&q;田文慧&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质教师\n五年一线教学授课经验，对事业单位言语考情深入研究，取得考情分析以及真题解析教研成果，线上班级学员进面率在粉笔受到过教学表彰。具有耐心细致，条理清晰的授课风格，让学生在轻松的学习氛围中，用更简单的方法，找到更快捷的解题之道，深受广大学员的认可和好评。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;174683219f2607b.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:16606,&q;episodeCount&q;:366,&q;scoreCount&q;:1194,&q;avgScore&q;:9.73869346733668,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.87,&q;updateTime&q;:1773369087008},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/2f9c832a1253642695693026547/50GavMWfNWMA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=7aff6adf6cedcf12abc57145610c6068&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7582,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10843504,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10843507,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【综应】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1751428800000,&q;endTime&q;:1751436000000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:26288,&q;userId&q;:52871684,&q;name&q;:&q;刘开心&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质教师\n5年一线教学经验，具有系统的专业理论知识。在职期间除了完成授课，同时兼顾教学研讨，熟悉命题及各地区考情动态，能力扎实。\n累计带笔试班学员人数超2000人，学员整体评分维持在4.8分以上；累计授课超过1000小时，评分达4.9分以上。\n课堂氛围轻松融洽，授课重点突出，思路清晰，讲解耐心细致，语言通俗易懂，擅长引导学生自主思考，并根据学生的不同情况和需求进行个性化指导。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;17692b3ab794012.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:26288,&q;episodeCount&q;:281,&q;scoreCount&q;:253,&q;avgScore&q;:9.794466403162055,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.9,&q;updateTime&q;:1773542090440},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:null,&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:6034,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10843507,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10843528,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【数资】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1751436000000,&q;endTime&q;:1751443200000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:61431,&q;userId&q;:97072356,&q;name&q;:&q;陈伶&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质教师\n长期从事公考一线教学，具有数资科目丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识，参与笔试教研，对数资方向有深入研究；撰写多篇事业单位笔试教研材料，多次参加粉笔教研活动，分享授课经验心得，助力粉笔理论研发升级，累计获得事业编、军队文职学员好评，具有深入浅出的授课风格，让学生在轻松的学习氛围中，用更简单的方法，找到更快捷的解题之道，是值得信赖的好导师。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;193b462a6079080.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:61431,&q;episodeCount&q;:256,&q;scoreCount&q;:763,&q;avgScore&q;:9.753604193971162,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.88,&q;updateTime&q;:1773491076279},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/92ef045f5145403709541396620/ShNRjQwtmN8A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=994c2b763453aa36eee2dbbf67be1373&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7539,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10843528,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10843536,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【公基非法】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1751443200000,&q;endTime&q;:1751450400000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:32718,&q;userId&q;:80360201,&q;name&q;:&q;张宝丁&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质教师\n多年一线教学授课经验，具有公基科目丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识，对考情深入研究，多次参加粉笔授课研讨会议，全面把握公考笔试命题趋势及最新考情，积累丰富知识，累计授课时长2000+，让学生在轻松的学习氛围中，用更简单的方法，找到更快捷的解题之道，深受广大学员的认可和好评；在学员中具有非常好的口碑，是值得信赖的好导师。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1794afa1686d904.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:32718,&q;episodeCount&q;:665,&q;scoreCount&q;:1043,&q;avgScore&q;:9.681687440076702,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.84,&q;updateTime&q;:1773616820914},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/72b1f9f11397757888022138571/Q1bBr4nSV70A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=2f95ac8a59f6994b28f11d556e31ce67&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7059,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10843536,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10843538,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【言语】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1751508000000,&q;endTime&q;:1751515200000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:17075,&q;userId&q;:44061788,&q;name&q;:&q;余寅波&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质教师\n拥有长达六年的一线教学授课经验，专注深耕于事业单位考试领域。曾承担过笔试精品班、刷题班等多种班型的教学任务。\n在言语科目方面，理论功底极为扎实，对各类言语考点均进行了细致入微的研究与梳理。授课过程中，逻辑清晰明了，态度耐心负责，课堂上十分注重将知识点与真题紧密结合，助力学员迅速掌握做题技巧。\n参与笔试教研以及解析撰写工作，对最新命题趋势有着精准把握，还多次踊跃参加授课研讨会议，秉持注重考场思维的理念，针对学生在学习过程中产生的困惑深入研究教学策略。\n累计授课时长超过 2000 小时，累计评分高达 4.9 分。教学中注重采用启发式引导方式，致力于让学生在轻松愉悦的学习氛围中，探寻到更为快捷的解题之道，深受广大学员的认可与好评。坚信 “没有比人更高的山”，始终愿助力每一位学员翻越自身面临的那座高山。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;17470c205d4814c.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:17075,&q;episodeCount&q;:379,&q;scoreCount&q;:1504,&q;avgScore&q;:9.699468085106375,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.85,&q;updateTime&q;:1773571929826},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:null,&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7067,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10843538,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:false,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10843540,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【综应】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1751515200000,&q;endTime&q;:1751522400000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:36424,&q;userId&q;:68075961,&q;name&q;:&q;周凡&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师\n五年一线教学授课经验，具有申论、综应科目丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识，承担过笔试精品班、刷题班、冲刺营等多种班型，熟悉各地方事业单位综合应用科目的真题特色和答题技巧。多次参加粉笔教研活动，注重自我提升，积极丰富更新理论知识。\n擅长启发式教学，将理论与实际结合引导学员形成逻辑思维，抓住学员痛点，针对性解决；授课风格生动亲和，互动性强，激发学员自主思考，深受学员喜爱。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;193af6a0ddc74ed.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:36424,&q;episodeCount&q;:186,&q;scoreCount&q;:310,&q;avgScore&q;:9.832258064516125,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.92,&q;updateTime&q;:1773451850353},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/8069d87c1253642696337003353/yZcT8GBR7s0A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=d6adc5739df5884a68595e7bb9a0a63f&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:6451,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10843540,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10843542,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【公基法律】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1751522400000,&q;endTime&q;:1751529600000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:32808,&q;userId&q;:83059591,&q;name&q;:&q;杨恬&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师。\n五年一线教学授课经验，深耕一线考试，承担过多种班型授课，经验丰富。\n多次参与笔试真题教研和解析撰写、模拟题撰写等工作，具有常识公基法律科目丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识，对常识公基法律考情有深入研究。\n累计带班学员超2000人，累计授课评分达4.9分，善于将知识以通俗易懂的方式进行讲解，课堂氛围轻松融洽。授课重点突出，能够及时总结拓展，广受学员好评。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;193af6183f51cdd.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;te