ortLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10795583,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【综应】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1751090400000,&q;endTime&q;:1751097600000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:35007,&q;userId&q;:84101851,&q;name&q;:&q;赵媛媛&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师\n6年一线教学经验，深耕事业单位笔试，服务学员达数千人，承担过江西、江苏、山东等线上线下笔试系统班、刷题班、冲刺班等多种班型，累计授课时长超1000小时，累计课程评分4.9分，经验丰富。\n2.定期参与综应科目培训和教研，多次参加真题解析及课程录制，了解最新命题趋势。\n3.理论基础扎实，授课经验丰富，能够从学员角度出发，耐心细致，条理清晰，以帮助学员上岸为己任，深受学员喜爱。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;196616e0bc722b2.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:35007,&q;episodeCount&q;:431,&q;scoreCount&q;:541,&q;avgScore&q;:9.878003696857672,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.94,&q;updateTime&q;:1773447824001},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/6b00b48a5145403714882865464/ZBjS2hCISDcA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=19816a3a520159d196e5ab181217b4d4&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7244,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10795583,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10795591,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【言语】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1751169600000,&q;endTime&q;:1751176800000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:16524,&q;userId&q;:49155632,&q;name&q;:&q;满晓堂&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师\n六年事业单位及公考教学经验，曾备战公考一次成功上岸，以本岗位笔试分数第一、面试第二的成绩顺利通过，原税务局在职公务员。累计授课超过1500小时，累计评分达4.9分。多次参与笔试教研与培训，不断提升，凭借敏锐洞察力与深厚专业素养，对模拟题方向有深刻见解。授课思路清晰，形象生动，擅长理论与实践相结合，举一反三夯实巩固，从而激发学员学习热情和自主意识，让学生在轻松的学习氛围中，用更简单的方法，找到更快捷的解题之道，在学员中具有非常好的口碑。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;17467879686bbe1.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:16524,&q;episodeCount&q;:492,&q;scoreCount&q;:1665,&q;avgScore&q;:9.77537537537537,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.89,&q;updateTime&q;:1773547501096},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/6d42b8e95145403714882953780/wGKek9PMDbkA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=fd2a39d484d775f3acaff1186a7899a6&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7262,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10795591,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10795609,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【综应】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1751184000000,&q;endTime&q;:1751191200000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:13527,&q;userId&q;:72790831,&q;name&q;:&q;安爱霞&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔综应优质讲师。\n5年多一线综应教学和带班经验，累计授课时长1200+，带班人次2000+，所带班级进面率高，学员整体评分5.0。\n多次参加粉笔综应科目教研，熟悉各类事业单位综应科目命题规律，重难点及不同题型的答题思路和方法，对联考、山东、江苏、浙江等省份事业单位的考情和备考策略了然于胸，专业知识扎实，带班经验丰富。\n清新温和，擅长总结做题规律和答题技巧，能够举一反三，帮助同学通过一道题掌握一类题的解题思路，谙熟学生各个阶段的备考心理，善于思维点拨和个性化辅导，实践性强，深受学员喜爱。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1737ee8a423e625.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:13527,&q;episodeCount&q;:432,&q;scoreCount&q;:650,&q;avgScore&q;:9.95076923076923,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.98,&q;updateTime&q;:1773460026169},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/c89b3a775145403709545414401/EobO1hNUCfwA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=235394db2773c64ad274454799390cd9&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:8088,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10795609,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10795665,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【公基法律】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1751248800000,&q;endTime&q;:1751256000000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:56386,&q;userId&q;:76976071,&q;name&q;:&q;郁青&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔常识公基优质教师，法学专业毕业，授课严谨细致，讲解通俗易懂，授课过程中，注重课堂氛围，氛围生动有趣，课堂上注重基础，帮助学员查缺补漏，不断提高做题技巧。耐心细致，照顾到每个学员，给予学习信心。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;184183d8b0babee.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:56386,&q;episodeCount&q;:171,&q;scoreCount&q;:369,&q;avgScore&q;:9.485094850948508,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.74,&q;updateTime&q;:1769951409746},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/cdcd208f1397757888023754303/1Gdmjad6mt8A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=56553ea9151bf559787449a83a34d47b&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7718,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10795665,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10795666,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【数资】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1751256000000,&q;endTime&q;:1751263200000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:16843,&q;userId&q;:69995718,&q;name&q;:&q;宋媛&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质教师\n6年一线授课讲解，始终以生动有趣、激发学生思维为教学宗旨，课堂氛围轻松融洽，广受学员好评。授课逻辑严谨重点突出，能够及时总结拓展，讲解语言通俗易懂。擅长引导学生自主思考，善于根据学生的不同情况和需求，制定合适的教学计划，进行个性化指导，助力学员上岸。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1746c88246d8c4b.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:16843,&q;episodeCount&q;:563,&q;scoreCount&q;:1897,&q;avgScore&q;:9.763837638376383,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.88,&q;updateTime&q;:1773542983485},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/3278835f5145403710498133916/2a2WKmSANLgA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=fecd9380c7b878c2b18ec355019021e5&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:6952,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10795666,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10795684,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【综应】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1751270400000,&q;endTime&q;:1751277600000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:35889,&q;userId&q;:59452309,&q;name&q;:&q;王昭媛&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师\n985院校硕士毕业，投身教育事业6年，拥有扎实一线教学经验。多次参与真题解析以及真题解析视频录制，积累大量实用经验，对各省份考情深入钻研，精准把握各地考试要点。\n授课思路清晰，熟练掌握各类题型的作答技巧，理论扎实，逻辑清晰，重点突出，耐心细致，在教学过程中因材施教，采用启发式教学法，激发学员的学习兴趣与思考能力。\n承担各种线上线下授课任务，累计服务学员上千人，授课超1000小时，累计评分达4.9分。始终秉持着“以学员为中心”的教学理念，在教学过程中因材施教，并能及时跟进学员的学习进度，耐心解答学员的疑问，为学员提供个性化的辅导与建议，深受学员喜爱。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;18f7000bcd332c6.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:35889,&q;episodeCount&q;:313,&q;scoreCount&q;:848,&q;avgScore&q;:9.818396226415093,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.91,&q;updateTime&q;:1773575413148},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/22bda7be5145403707387441415/gXaZC0lUKVsA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=a57ab9a520ff41c2fe2822f31d725d60&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7010,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10795684,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10600531,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【数资】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1746496800000,&q;endTime&q;:1746504000000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:56432,&q;userId&q;:96015899,&q;name&q;:&q;李秋霖&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质教师\n4年一线教学授课经验，具有数资科目丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识。参与命制笔试教研，对资料分析方向有深入研究，并撰写多篇事业单位笔试教研材料，在粉笔笔试教师内部进行共享。多次参加粉笔教研活动，分享授课经验心得，助力粉笔理论研发升级。获得学员的多次好评，具有热情洋溢的授课风格，让学生在轻松的学习氛围中，用更简单的方法，找到更快捷的解题之道，深受广大学员的认可和好评。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;18488bc569ccb4d.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:56432,&q;episodeCount&q;:274,&q;scoreCount&q;:785,&q;avgScore&q;:9.76305732484077,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.88,&q;updateTime&q;:1773590328512},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/160ff7b15145403709427487787/AMGHBIZnUaYA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=5bd04e214d72bef5a7d368b737db12f4&q;},&q;memberO