l&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10603563,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【公基法律】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1747101600000,&q;endTime&q;:1747108800000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:26000,&q;userId&q;:79045931,&q;name&q;:&q;曾国芳&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔常识公基优质教师。\n5年一线教学授课经验。多次参与粉笔授课研讨会议，具有法律科目丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识，曾参与命制笔试教研和真题解析撰写工作，熟悉常识公基笔试考情。\n累计授课时长1000+，综合评分4.9，授课思路清晰明了，条理分明，能够准确地把握课程的重点，讲解风格流畅自然，语言通俗易懂，注重及时对所学内容进行总结、梳理与回顾，帮助学员巩固所学知识，构建知识框架。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1983b115f298514.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:26000,&q;episodeCount&q;:550,&q;scoreCount&q;:786,&q;avgScore&q;:9.715012722646309,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.86,&q;updateTime&q;:1773579521495},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/62b81e155145403710098214091/A9nD0SODvSgA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=c9496142d0c559efda8f86b4d90a68a7&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7094,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10603563,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSa