q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【数资】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1747620000000,&q;endTime&q;:1747627200000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:56632,&q;userId&q;:71763689,&q;name&q;:&q;张程&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质教师\n985硕士毕业，深耕事业单位考试，三年一线教学授课经验，实战与授课经验丰富。\n全面了解数量关系和资料分析答题技巧，授课逻辑清晰，教研教学扎实刻苦:\n曾参与笔试真题教研和解析撰写工作;\n注重考场思维，针对学生困惑研究教学策略，授课重点突出，及时总结拓展;\n学生口碑:累计授课超2000小时，累计评分达4.9分，注重启发式引导，课堂氛围轻松融洽，讲解语言通俗易懂。善于根据学生的不同情况和需求，制定合适的教学计划，进行个性化指导，助力学员上岸。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;184e197c2940672.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:56632,&q;episodeCount&q;:353,&q;scoreCount&q;:1032,&q;avgScore&q;:9.899224806201547,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.95,&q;updateTime&q;:1773106304338},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/c5aecd615145403709538523381/FhVtVkaUXp0A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=698fd039e524a09319371f0eda81fd2c&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7587,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10604426,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10603825,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【综应】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1747627200000,&q;endTime&q;:1747634400000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:36424,&q;userId&q;:68075961,&q;name&q;:&q;周凡&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师\n五年一线教学授课经验，具有申论、综应科目丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识，承担过笔试精品班、刷题班、冲刺营等多种班型，熟悉各地方事业单位综合应用科目的真题特色和答题技巧。多次参加粉笔教研活动，注重自我提升，积极丰富更新理论知识。\n擅长启发式教学，将理论与实际结合引导学员形成逻辑思维，抓住学员痛点，针对性解决；授课风格生动亲和，互动性强，激发学员自主思考，深受学员喜爱。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;193af6a0ddc74ed.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:36424,&q;episodeCount&q;:186,&q;scoreCount&q;:310,&q;avgScore&q;:9.832258064516125,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.92,&q;updateTime&q;:1773451850353},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/8069d87c1253642696337003353/yZcT8GBR7s0A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=d6adc5739df5884a68595e7bb9a0a63f&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:6047,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10603825,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10604350,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【言语】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1747706400000,&q;endTime&q;:1747713600000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:16686,&q;userId&q;:69893637,&q;name&q;:&q;刘期期&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师\n毕业于211大学，投身教育事业6年时间，对言语科目有丰富的实践经验，参与真题的解析和模拟题的命制，课程累计评分4.9分。了解考场答题思维及应变技巧，注重启发式授课，让学生在轻松的氛围中找到高效的解题方法。授课风格风趣幽默，课堂互动性强，善于从学员角度出发解决个性化问题，激发学员学习热情和自主意识，注重理论与实践相结合。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1746bbe5d160d43.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:16686,&q;episodeCount&q;:447,&q;scoreCount&q;:2045,&q;avgScore&q;:9.762347188264059,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.88,&q;updateTime&q;:1773546406556},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/077558931397757911915926552/PpFe6z48T8UA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=6bc5b6dbf5223797c9f2083c2bb5bf66&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7613,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10604350,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10604351,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【数资】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1747713600000,&q;endTime&q;:1747720800000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:23908,&q;userId&q;:78283874,&q;name&q;:&q;许苗苗&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师\n六年一线教学授课经验，承担过线上、线下笔试精品班多种班型课程，授课经验丰富，擅于总结知识点。\n有扎实的理论知识基础和丰富的实战经验，全面把握各个地区的考试情况和命题趋势，可以更好辨析不同知识点的区别关键点，解决学员的疑惑点；目前授课评分达4.9分，善于归纳和总结数资的学习方法，授课思维逻辑严谨清晰，通俗易懂，能帮助学员提供多种解题思路，更好地理解掌握数资内容，提高答题的正确率和速度，深受学员好评。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1945f3cf66cbd8c.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:23908,&q;episodeCount&q;:430,&q;scoreCount&q;:1123,&q;avgScore&q;:9.861086375779168,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.93,&q;updateTime&q;:1766110373004},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/8b9d686f1253642696527671297/OhQurD2xhWsA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=41febbbae155f49bcac8f627babcda5f&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:8010,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10604351,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10604352,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【综应】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1747720800000,&q;endTime&q;:1747728000000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:32032,&q;userId&q;:81559433,&q;name&q;:&q;陈绮桐&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质教师\n五年一线教学经验\n熟练掌握各地区事业单位考情，参与多次教研，撰写多篇事业单位笔试教研材料，在粉笔教师内部进行共享。\n线上累计授课小时1000+，学员评分整体维持4.9，也有线下授课经历，授课经验丰富。课堂氛围轻松愉悦，授课思路清晰，深入浅出讲解如何破解综应难题。通过引导学员思考进而巩固理论基础，理顺解题思路，让学员克服难下笔，不动笔难题，达到提高分数的目的。\n提供多样化的辅导技巧，善于结合学员基础进行针对性辅导，有效解决学员疑惑，曾帮助0基础学员在成功提分20+。\n帮助不少学员成功进面，在过往学员评价中深受好评，是学员值得信赖的老师。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1983b323cb8eb84.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:32032,&q;episodeCount&q;:290,&q;scoreCount&q;:409,&q;avgScore&q;:9.877750611246935,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.94,&q;updateTime&q;:1773554942877},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/a9b323de5145403714883224921/TLnAfMW95fwA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=966d9114718757bc81c712e4601c4943&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:6549,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10604352,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:false},{&q;id&q;:10604355,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【数资】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1747792800000,&q;endTime&q;:1747800000000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:15889,&q;userId&q;:64389211,&q;name&q;:&q;佟兴苗&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师\n6年一线教育教学经验，承担各种线上线下授课任务；\n多次参与模拟题撰写、真题解析等日常教研活动，对于各类考试考情、考试重点有深入了解；\n授课风格严谨认真，心思细腻，善于倾听学员的学习诉求，并及时回应。讲课细致耐心，课堂氛围轻松活跃，学员可以获得良好的学习体验。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;193b3955985d9e8.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:15889,&q;episodeCount&q;:428,&q;scoreCount&q;:1564,&q;avgScore&q;:9.84526854219949,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.92,&q;updateTime&q;:1773477236816},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/d5f243805145403719017149437/AMt7Sct1Kn4A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=65cfa849fb35c3672bb4b6b6eb409bc4&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7779,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10604355,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10604358,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【言语】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1747807200000,&q;endTime&q;:1747814400000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:52949,&q;userId&q;:80481411,&q;name&q;:&q;王臻瑶&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师\n211高校毕业，6年一线教学、教研经验，线上线下授课人数千余人，累计授课时长3000+。\n对于言语理解与表达科目有丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识。\n亲和力强，注重与学员的互动和交流，对各省份考情熟悉，注重理论与实践相结合，引导学员发现问题，帮助学员高分上岸，深受学员喜爱。\n教学风格注重条理性和逻辑性，善于通过生动的例子，帮助学员深入理解题目背后的逻辑关系和解题技巧。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1945f3b6384d792.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:52949,&q;episodeCount&q;:342,&q;scoreCount&q;:1475,&q;avgScore&q;:9.738305084745754,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.87,&q;updateTime&q;:1773588704179},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://nodestatic.fbstatic.cn/video_qhd/1714474745775.mp4&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7582,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10604358,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10604364,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【数资】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1747879200000,&q;endTime&q;:1747886400000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:26292,&q;userId&q;:79327575,&q;name&q;:&q;郑美娟&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔数量关系与资料分析科目优质教师\n5年一线教学授课经验。\n具有数资科目丰富的实践经验及系统扎实的专业理论知识。多次参与粉笔数资授课研讨，教学教研能力扎实。承担过线下笔试精品班、刷题班、冲刺班等多种班型，授课经验丰富，思路清晰，讲解全面细致。\n授课形式生动形象，能够有针对性的引导学生进行主动思考，课堂氛围轻松无压力。擅长化繁为简，适合各个阶段的学生，深受广大学员好评。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1777f9e082273e5.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:26292,&q;episodeCount&q;:567,&q;scoreCount&q;:1594,&q;avgScore&q;:9.803011292346305,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.9,&q;updateTime&q;:1773586366104},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/9f3a48475145403713947309566/MDmpFEIP6G8A.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=39fd01bda5913d3e938e577986d9db4b&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:8132,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10604364,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10603655,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【公基法律】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1747886400000,&q;endTime&q;:1747893600000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:32713,&q;userId&q;:74303567,&q;name&q;:&q;李佳琪&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师\n5年一线教学经验，承担过线上多种班型。\n承担常识公基法律与判断推理两个学科领域的督学与授课，相关理论内容基础扎实，日常承担多项工作，包括真题解析、单题录制、撰写教研文章以及直播授课等，总授课时长超过一千小时。\n学员口碑：课程累计评分为达4.9，课堂氛围轻松，考点讲解清晰，擅长举例讲解，让学员易于接受知识点。课堂上也善于引导学员思考，加深对考点的记忆，备受学员喜爱。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1984f1cfc0e94f5.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:32713,&q;episodeCount&q;:636,&q;scoreCount&q;:868,&q;avgScore&q;:9.887096774193548,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.94,&q;updateTime&q;:1773579049093},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2vodbj1251001446/ca9a07581397757888016826661/lrMasTgKVqQA.mp4?t=f2a4b300&a;us=4070880000&a;sign=2b5bbe0bde9ea6d06b056222865a2b6a&q;},&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7351,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10603655,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10604368,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【言语】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1747900800000,&q;endTime&q;:1747908000000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:16736,&q;userId&q;:73894787,&q;name&q;:&q;韩娇&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质教师\n具有6年丰富的一线授课经验，累计授课时长已超过6000小时。幽默诙谐、形象生动的教学风格，能让学生在轻松愉快的氛围中掌握复杂的知识点。同时，注重条理清晰的讲解和思维跳跃的启发，帮助学生构建系统的知识框架，激发他们的学习潜能，深受广大学员的认可和好评，是学员值得信赖的优秀教师。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;19bbc3030662940.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:16736,&q;episodeCount&q;:460,&q;scoreCount&q;:1722,&q;avgScore&q;:9.746806039488957,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.87,&q;updateTime&q;:1772978351208},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https: