00小时，累计评分达4.9分，善于把握学员个性化特点，因材施教，认真负责，真诚对待每一位学员。讲课生动形象，有代入感，学员可以在轻松愉快的氛围中学习，跟着老师节奏主动思考，学习知识，掌握知识。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;1983ba750d61d0b.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:34183,&q;episodeCount&q;:689,&q;scoreCount&q;:1641,&q;avgScore&q;:9.802559414990869,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.9,&q;updateTime&q;:1771456495223},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:null,&q;memberOfCPC&q;:false,&q;tags&q;:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:9112,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10139718,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10139723,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【言语】精选好题 沉浸刷题 &q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1742781600000,&q;endTime&q;:1742788800000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:17176,&q;userId&q;:73973279,&q;name&q;:&q;袁美玲&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师\n具有五年一线教学授课经验、熟知言语科目考查特点和高频考点、授课风格细致严谨，善于从知识点出发剖析入微，讲解透彻。累计授课时长1000＋、线上线下经验丰富，深得学生喜爱。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;17554099889d717.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayC