:null},&q;teachChannel&q;:1,&q;offline&q;:null,&q;duration&q;:7429,&q;hasAudition&q;:false,&q;bizType&q;:0,&q;bizId&q;:&q;726825&q;,&q;supportReplay&q;:true,&q;extraInfo&q;:null,&q;liveConfig&q;:{&q;episodeId&q;:10136598,&q;supportMultiGroup&q;:false,&q;exerciseBizType&q;:0,&q;videoDisplayType&q;:0,&q;avForwardType&q;:0,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasStrokeKeynote&q;:true,&q;verticalModeType&q;:0,&q;originEpisodeId&q;:0,&q;supportRtmp&q;:false,&q;supportPk&q;:true,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportUserNoteStroke&q;:false,&q;communicateType&q;:0,&q;one2One&q;:false,&q;fakeLive&q;:false},&q;validStatus&q;:1,&q;supportLive&q;:true,&q;supportAiCatalog&q;:false,&q;hasIntelligentPen&q;:false,&q;useLocalRecording&q;:false,&q;useIntelligentRoom&q;:false,&q;hasSalePosition&q;:false,&q;hasEpisodeCards&q;:true,&q;lockedForShouna&q;:false,&q;needSignIn&q;:false,&q;needTeacherSignIn&q;:false,&q;enablePadPencil&q;:true,&q;displayExercise&q;:false,&q;supportLuckyBag&q;:true,&q;supportLivePk&q;:true},{&q;id&q;:10136602,&q;kePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;courseId&q;:6,&q;status&q;:3,&q;playStatus&q;:3,&q;type&q;:33,&q;recordingType&q;:0,&q;mediaType&q;:0,&q;title&q;:&q;【综应】精选好题 沉浸刷题&q;,&q;innerTitle&q;:&q;&q;,&q;startTime&q;:1740016800000,&q;endTime&q;:1740024000000,&q;teacher&q;:{&q;id&q;:64118,&q;userId&q;:119499857,&q;name&q;:&q;闫瑶&q;,&q;brief&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师&q;,&q;desc&q;:&q;粉笔优质讲师\n5年综应一线教学经验，累计评分4.9。\n1.具有丰富的综应理论储备，精通公务员，事业单位等考情分析。灵活变通，因材施教，更好帮助学生搭建综应框架。\n2.多次参加粉笔授课线下研讨会议，全面把握事业单位综应的命题趋势及最新考情，互相分享授课经验心得，积累丰富的综应授课方式。\n3.授课风格新颖，擅于引导学生思考，在框架上发散思维，关注个性化培养，让每位学生都能在思维内清晰掌握综应答题技巧，有效提升综应成绩，深受学员喜爱。&q;,&q;avatar&q;:&q;191dfeaf0442e06.jpg&q;,&q;upperBodyPhoto&q;:null,&q;displayCoursePrefix&q;:&q;sydw&q;,&q;teacherStat&q;:{&q;teacherId&q;:64118,&q;episodeCount&q;:723,&q;scoreCount&q;:722,&q;avgScore&q;:9.72299168975069,&q;fiveGradeAvgScore&q;:4.86,&q;updateTime&q;:1773059619278},&q;auditionEpisode&q;:{&q;episodeTitle&q;:&q;个人展示课&q;,&q;episodeVideoUrl&q;:&q;https://vod.fbstatic.cn/22e9ceb2